B.a3t=new A.a(B.ay,["Alege o oal\u0103 cu fund gros, potrivit\u0103 pentru plit\u0103. Varianta de mai jos se fierbe pe aragaz; oala de lut trebuie folosit\u0103 numai dac\u0103 produc\u0103torul o permite. Gust\u0103 o buc\u0103\u021bic\u0103 de varz\u0103 \xeenainte s\u0103 adaugi sare. Preg\u0103te\u0219te 2 linguri de ulei, 50 ml ap\u0103 rece pentru umplutur\u0103 \u0219i ap\u0103 fierbinte pentru completat.","Oal\u0103 de 4\u20135 litri cu capac, tigaie, bol, toc\u0103tor, cu\u021bit \u0219i termometru alimentar.","Umple lejer frunzele \u0219i men\u021bine fierberea domoal\u0103. Verific\u0103 separat foaia de varz\u0103, orezul \u0219i carnea: timpul singur nu spune dac\u0103 toate sunt gata.",B.XP,!0,"principale_4_6","25.10.2026",B.Uz,u.h,"\u2022 700 g carne tocat\u0103 amestec porc \u0219i vit\u0103\n\u2022 1 varz\u0103 murat\u0103 mare\n\u2022 80 g orez cu bob rotund\n\u2022 3 cepe mari\n\u2022 150 g costi\u021b\u0103 sau sl\u0103nin\u0103 afumat\u0103\n\u2022 3 linguri past\u0103 de tomate\n\u2022 200 ml suc de ro\u0219ii\n\u2022 2 linguri ulei\n\u2022 50 ml ap\u0103 rece pentru umplutur\u0103\n\u2022 2 crengu\u021be cimbru uscat \u0219i 2 foi de dafin\n\u2022 Sare, piper \u0219i boia dup\u0103 gust\n\u2022 Ap\u0103 fierbinte c\xe2t s\u0103 acopere sarmalele \u0219i pentru completare",B.XU,B.ZX,"1. Preg\u0103te\u0219te foile. Desf\u0103 varza, cl\u0103te\u0219te frunzele \u0219i gust\u0103 o buc\u0103\u021bic\u0103. Dac\u0103 sunt excesiv de s\u0103rate, las\u0103-le \xeen ap\u0103 rece \u0219i gust\u0103 din nou. Sub\u021biaz\u0103 nervurile groase cu cu\u021bitul, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 g\u0103ure\u0219ti foaia; toac\u0103 separat resturile. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Foile se \xeendoaie u\u0219or \u0219i nu sunt prea s\u0103rate.\n2. \xcenmoaie ceapa. Toac\u0103 cele 3 cepe \xeen cuburi mici. Pune-le \xeen tigaie cu 2 linguri de ulei \u0219i g\u0103te\u0219te la foc mic-mediu aproximativ 8 minute, amestec\xe2nd. Dac\u0103 se prind \xeenainte s\u0103 se \xeenmoaie, adaug\u0103 o lingur\u0103 de ap\u0103. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Ceapa este moale \u0219i translucid\u0103, f\u0103r\u0103 margini arse.\n3. Adaug\u0103 orezul \u0219i r\u0103core\u0219te baza. Cl\u0103te\u0219te \u0219i scurge cele 80 g de orez. Adaug\u0103-l peste ceap\u0103 \u0219i amestec\u0103 2 minute la foc mic. Mut\u0103 amestecul \xeentr-un bol lat \u0219i las\u0103-l s\u0103 se r\u0103coreasc\u0103 p\xe2n\u0103 nu mai este fierbinte. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Baza de ceap\u0103 \u0219i orez poate fi amestecat\u0103 cu carnea f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 o \xeenc\u0103lzeasc\u0103.\n4. Preg\u0103te\u0219te umplutura. Pune carnea \xeen bol, adaug\u0103 baza r\u0103corit\u0103, cele 3 linguri de past\u0103 de tomate, piper \u0219i pu\u021bin\u0103 boia. Toarn\u0103 50 ml ap\u0103 rece \u0219i amestec\u0103 scurt p\xe2n\u0103 se distribuie. S\u0103reaz\u0103 cu pruden\u021b\u0103, \u021bin\xe2nd cont de varz\u0103 \u0219i afum\u0103tur\u0103. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Compozi\u021bia este uniform\u0103 \u0219i moale, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 curg\u0103. Ai grij\u0103: Nu gusta umplutura crud\u0103. Pentru ajustare, g\u0103te\u0219te separat o buc\u0103\u021bic\u0103 p\xe2n\u0103 la minimum 72\xb0C.\n5. Ruleaz\u0103 sarmalele. \xcentinde o foaie cu partea neted\u0103 \xeen jos. Pune o por\u021bie de umplutur\u0103 la un cap\u0103t, pliaz\u0103 lateralele peste ea \u0219i ruleaz\u0103 f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 str\xe2ngi excesiv. Folose\u0219te por\u021bii apropiate ca m\u0103rime \u0219i p\u0103streaz\u0103 restul umpluturii la rece dac\u0103 lucrezi mai lent. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Rulourile sunt \xeenchise la capete, dar nu \xeendesate.\n6. A\u0219az\u0103 \xeen oal\u0103 \u0219i adaug\u0103 lichid. Pune varz\u0103 tocat\u0103 pe fund, apoi sarmalele \u0219i afum\u0103tura \xeen straturi. Distribuie cimbrul \u0219i dafinul, acoper\u0103 cu varza r\u0103mas\u0103 \u0219i toarn\u0103 cei 200 ml suc de ro\u0219ii. Completeaz\u0103 cu ap\u0103 fierbinte p\xe2n\u0103 acoper\u0103 sarmalele. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Rulourile sunt sus\u021binute de vecine \u0219i acoperite cu lichid.\n7. Fierbe lent \u0219i verific\u0103 lichidul. Adu la fierbere, apoi redu la foc foarte mic \u0219i pune capacul u\u0219or \xeentredeschis. Las\u0103 circa 3 ore, verific\xe2nd periodic s\u0103 nu se prind\u0103 \u0219i complet\xe2nd cu ap\u0103 fierbinte. Nu amesteca printre sarmale cu lingura. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Lichidul bolborose\u0219te discret, iar sarmalele \xee\u0219i p\u0103streaz\u0103 forma. Ai grij\u0103: Cronometrul este un reper; varza mai tare poate cere g\u0103tire suplimentar\u0103.\n8. Verific\u0103 o sarma din mijloc. Scoate atent o sarma \u0219i m\u0103soar\u0103 minimum 72\xb0C \xeen centrul umpluturii. Taie-o: orezul trebuie s\u0103 fie complet moale, iar varza s\u0103 se taie f\u0103r\u0103 rezisten\u021b\u0103. Dac\u0103 oricare r\u0103m\xe2ne tare, continu\u0103 fierberea cu suficient lichid. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Carnea are temperatura necesar\u0103, orezul nu are miez tare \u0219i foaia este fraged\u0103.\n9. Odihne\u0219te \u0219i serve\u0219te. Opre\u0219te focul \u0219i las\u0103 oala acoperit\u0103 15 minute. Scoate sarmalele cu o lingur\u0103 lat\u0103, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 tragi de foaie. Gust\u0103 sosul \u0219i serve\u0219te-l al\u0103turi, cu adaosuri la alegere. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Sarmalele pot fi ridicate f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 se desfac\u0103."],t.R)
B.atf=new A.a(B.c,["Cur\u0103\u021b\u0103 ardeii","Spal\u0103 ardeii. Decupeaz\u0103 capacele \xeen jurul codi\u021bei, scoate semin\u021bele \u0219i nervurile, apoi cl\u0103te\u0219te interiorul. P\u0103streaz\u0103 capacele \u0219i las\u0103 ardeii s\u0103 se scurg\u0103 cu gura \xeen jos.","Ardeii sunt \xeentregi \u0219i f\u0103r\u0103 semin\u021be.","",0,B.b],t.M)
B.bs=s([360],t.t)
B.aoZ=new A.a(B.c,["C\u0103le\u0219te ceapa \u0219i las-o s\u0103 se r\u0103coreasc\u0103","Toac\u0103 cele 2 cepe fin. \xcenmoaie-le \xeen 2 linguri de ulei la foc mic-mediu circa 6 minute, amestec\xe2nd. Mut\u0103-le \xeentr-un bol \u0219i las\u0103-le p\xe2n\u0103 nu mai sunt fierbin\u021bi.","Ceapa este moale, f\u0103r\u0103 por\u021biuni brune.","",1,B.bs],t.M)
B.amg=new A.a(B.c,["Amestec\u0103 umplutura","Cl\u0103te\u0219te \u0219i scurge orezul. Pune carnea, ceapa r\u0103corit\u0103, orezul crud, oul \u0219i verdea\u021ba tocat\u0103 \xeentr-un bol. Adaug\u0103 pu\u021bin\u0103 sare \u0219i piper \u0219i amestec\u0103 p\xe2n\u0103 se distribuie ingredientele.","Nu mai exist\u0103 zone separate de ou sau orez.","Nu gusta carnea crud\u0103. Oul leag\u0103 compozi\u021bia, dar nu trebuie suplimentat.",1,B.b],t.M)
B.amD=new A.a(B.c,["Umple f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 presezi","Distribuie compozi\u021bia \xeen ardei p\xe2n\u0103 la aproximativ 1 cm sub margine. A\u0219az\u0103 capacele f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 le presezi \xeen umplutur\u0103. Pune ardeii \xeen picioare, unul l\xe2ng\u0103 altul, \xeen crati\u021b\u0103.","Ardeii sunt stabili \u0219i au loc pentru umflarea orezului.","",2,B.b],t.M)
B.av=s([2700],t.t)
B.alA=new A.a(B.c,["Fierbe domol","Toarn\u0103 ap\u0103 fierbinte p\xe2n\u0103 la trei sferturi din \xeen\u0103l\u021bimea ardeilor. Adu la fierbere, redu la foc mic \u0219i acoper\u0103. Fierbe orientativ 45 de minute; verific\u0103 nivelul lichidului \u0219i completeaz\u0103 dac\u0103 scade mult.","Ardeii \xeencep s\u0103 se \xeenmoaie \u0219i lichidul fierbe u\u0219or.","",3,B.av],t.M)
B.alm=new A.a(B.c,["Preg\u0103te\u0219te sosul de ro\u0219ii","Amestec\u0103 f\u0103ina cu 3 linguri de ap\u0103 rece p\xe2n\u0103 nu mai sunt cocoloa\u0219e, apoi cu sucul de ro\u0219ii. Toarn\u0103 pe l\xe2ng\u0103 ardei \u0219i mi\u0219c\u0103 u\u0219or crati\u021ba ca s\u0103 distribui sosul. Dac\u0103 sucul este foarte concentrat, dilueaz\u0103-l cu pu\u021bin\u0103 ap\u0103.","Sosul este omogen, f\u0103r\u0103 bulg\u0103ri de f\u0103in\u0103.","",4,B.b],t.M)
B.aqQ=new A.a(B.c,["Leag\u0103 sosul \u0219i verific\u0103 umplutura","Mai fierbe la foc mic aproximativ 15 minute, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 amesteci printre ardei. Verific\u0103 minimum 72\xb0C \xeen centrul umpluturii unui ardei mare \u0219i taie-l: orezul trebuie s\u0103 fie moale. Continu\u0103 fierberea dac\u0103 nu este gata.","Ardeiul este fraged, orezul p\u0103truns \u0219i sosul nu mai are gust de f\u0103in\u0103 crud\u0103.","",4,B.u],t.M)
B.atk=new A.a(B.c,["Potrive\u0219te gustul \u0219i serve\u0219te","Gust\u0103 sosul complet g\u0103tit \u0219i ajusteaz\u0103 sarea \u0219i piperul. Ridic\u0103 ardeii cu o lingur\u0103 mare, sus\u021bin\xe2nd baza. Pune sos \xeen farfurie \u0219i verdea\u021b\u0103 deasupra; sm\xe2nt\xe2na este doar un adaos op\u021bional la servire.","Ardeii r\u0103m\xe2n \xeentregi la transfer, iar sosul curge lent.","",5,B.b],t.M)
