B.a3p=new A.a(B.ay,["Aceast\u0103 variant\u0103 folose\u0219te varz\u0103 dulce \u0219i ciolan afumat dezosat. Cite\u0219te eticheta ciolanului: poate fi crud-afumat sau deja fiert. Preg\u0103te\u0219te carnea conform instruc\u021biunilor produsului \xeenainte de a o pune cu varza. Nu ad\u0103uga mult\u0103 sare \xeenainte s\u0103 gu\u0219ti afum\u0103tura.","Oal\u0103 pentru ciolan, crati\u021b\u0103 mare, tav\u0103 cu capac, cu\u021bit, lingur\u0103 \u0219i m\u0103nu\u0219i de cuptor.","Fr\u0103gezirea verzei se verific\u0103 prin textur\u0103, nu prin promisiunea c\u0103 masarea cu sare \xeenjum\u0103t\u0103\u021be\u0219te timpul. Pune ro\u0219iile dup\u0103 ce varza s-a \xeenmuiat par\u021bial \u0219i p\u0103streaz\u0103 suficient lichid \xeen tav\u0103.",B.QJ,!0,"principale_4_6","25.10.2026",B.Uo,u.h,"\u2022 1,5 kg varz\u0103 alb\u0103 dulce\n\u2022 600 g ciolan afumat dezosat\n\u2022 2 cepe mari\n\u2022 200 g ro\u0219ii pasate\n\u2022 2 linguri ulei\n\u2022 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 cimbru \u0219i 2 foi de dafin\n\u2022 Sare \u0219i piper dup\u0103 gust\n\u2022 Aproximativ 250 ml sup\u0103 nes\u0103rat\u0103 de la ciolan sau ap\u0103; suplimentar dup\u0103 nevoie",B.nl,B.a1w,"1. G\u0103te\u0219te ciolanul conform etichetei. Dac\u0103 este crud-afumat, pune-l \xeen ap\u0103 c\xe2t s\u0103-l acopere \u0219i fierbe conform ambalajului, apoi continu\u0103 domol p\xe2n\u0103 se \xeen\u021beap\u0103 u\u0219or cu furculi\u021ba. Dac\u0103 este deja fiert, urmeaz\u0103 indica\u021biile pentru \xeenc\u0103lzire. Nu folosi doar culoarea afumat\u0103 ca dovad\u0103 de g\u0103tire. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Ciolanul este complet g\u0103tit \u0219i fraged.\n2. Taie carnea \u0219i p\u0103streaz\u0103 lichidul. Scoate carnea cu grij\u0103, verific\u0103 s\u0103 nu existe fragmente de os \u0219i taie buc\u0103\u021bi potrivite. Strecoar\u0103 supa \u0219i gust-o dup\u0103 fierbere: dac\u0103 este prea s\u0103rat\u0103, folose\u0219te ap\u0103 pentru varz\u0103. M\u0103soar\u0103 aproximativ 250 ml lichid. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Ai buc\u0103\u021bi fragede \u0219i un lichid care nu este prea s\u0103rat.\n3. Preg\u0103te\u0219te varza. \xcendep\u0103rteaz\u0103 frunzele deteriorate, cl\u0103te\u0219te varza \u0219i scoate cotorul. Taie f\xe2\u0219ii sub\u021biri \u0219i fr\u0103m\xe2nt\u0103 u\u0219or cu foarte pu\u021bin\u0103 sare. Toac\u0103 ceapa. Porne\u0219te cuptorul la 180\xb0C sus-jos. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Varza este t\u0103iat\u0103 uniform \u0219i \xeencape treptat \xeen crati\u021b\u0103.\n4. \xcenmoaie ceapa \u0219i varza. \xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te 2 linguri de ulei \u0219i g\u0103te\u0219te ceapa circa 6 minute la foc mic-mediu. Adaug\u0103 varza \xeen tran\u0219e, amestec\xe2nd dup\u0103 fiecare. Toarn\u0103 pu\u021bin din lichidul m\u0103surat \u0219i g\u0103te\u0219te \xeenc\u0103 10 minute, p\xe2n\u0103 scade \xeen volum. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Varza \xeencepe s\u0103 fie flexibil\u0103, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 se ard\u0103 pe fund.\n5. Adaug\u0103 carnea \u0219i ro\u0219iile. Amestec\u0103 varza cu ciolanul, ro\u0219iile, cimbrul, dafinul \u0219i piperul. Transfer\u0103 \xeen tav\u0103 \u0219i completeaz\u0103 cu restul celor aproximativ 250 ml lichid. Nu \xeeneca varza; lichidul trebuie s\u0103 umezeasc\u0103 baza. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Carnea \u0219i sosul sunt distribuite \xeen tav\u0103.\n6. Coace acoperit. Acoper\u0103 tava \u0219i coace 30 de minute la 180\xb0C. Ridic\u0103 atent capacul \u0219i \xeencearc\u0103 varza: dac\u0103 \xeenc\u0103 este tare, continu\u0103 acoperit, complet\xe2nd pu\u021bin lichid c\xe2nd este necesar. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Varza este moale sau aproape moale \u0219i nu exist\u0103 por\u021biuni uscate.\n7. Las\u0103 s\u0103 scad\u0103 \u0219i verific\u0103. C\xe2nd varza este fraged\u0103, mai coace aproximativ 15 minute f\u0103r\u0103 capac. Pentru ciolanul prefiert, verific\u0103 re\xeenc\u0103lzirea la minimum 74\xb0C \xeen centru. Dac\u0103 suprafa\u021ba se coloreaz\u0103 prea repede, acoper\u0103 din nou. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Varza este fraged\u0103, carnea fierbinte \u0219i sosul redus.\n8. Regleaz\u0103 gustul \u0219i serve\u0219te. Scoate dafinul. Gust\u0103 varza \u0219i completeaz\u0103 sarea doar dac\u0103 mai trebuie. Serve\u0219te cu pu\u021bin suc din tav\u0103; p\xe2inea sau m\u0103m\u0103liga se adaug\u0103 dup\u0103 preferin\u021b\u0103. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Gustul afum\u0103turii nu este acoperit de sare \xeen exces."],t.R)
B.dS=s([43200],t.t)
B.ana=new A.a(B.c,["\xcenmoaie fasolea din ajun","Urmeaz\u0103 ambalajul. Dac\u0103 lipsesc indica\u021biile, acoper\u0103 fasolea uscat\u0103 cu ap\u0103 din bel\u0219ug \u0219i las-o minimum 12 ore, la rece. Folose\u0219te un bol mare: boabele \xee\u0219i m\u0103resc volumul. Arunc\u0103 apa de \xeenmuiere \u0219i cl\u0103te\u0219te.","Boabele sunt hidratate, iar apa de \xeenmuiere a fost eliminat\u0103.","",-1,B.dS],t.M)
B.apQ=new A.a(B.c,["Fierbe corect boabele","Pune fasolea \xeen ap\u0103 proasp\u0103t\u0103 c\xe2t s\u0103 dep\u0103\u0219easc\u0103 boabele cu c\xe2\u021biva centimetri. \xcen lipsa instruc\u021biunilor produc\u0103torului, fierbe \xeen clocot minimum 30 de minute, apoi continu\u0103 p\xe2n\u0103 este complet fraged\u0103. Completeaz\u0103 cu ap\u0103 fierbinte; nu o l\u0103sa s\u0103 se usuce.","O boab\u0103 r\u0103corit\u0103 se zdrobe\u0219te u\u0219or, f\u0103r\u0103 miez f\u0103inos sau tare.","Cele 30 de minute sunt un minim de fierbere, nu garan\u021bia c\u0103 boabele sunt fragede. Nu le gusta insuficient g\u0103tite.",-1,B.aq],t.M)
B.aq5=new A.a(B.c,["P\u0103streaz\u0103 lichid \u0219i preg\u0103te\u0219te legumele","Scurge boabele numai dup\u0103 ce sunt g\u0103tite \u0219i p\u0103streaz\u0103 aproximativ 500 ml ap\u0103 de fierbere. Toac\u0103 ceapa m\u0103runt, rade morcovul sau taie-l \xeen cuburi mici. Preg\u0103te\u0219te pasta de tomate \u0219i condimentele.","Ai fasole fraged\u0103 \u0219i lichid rezervat pentru sos.","",-1,B.b],t.M)
B.ao6=new A.a(B.c,["G\u0103te\u0219te c\xe2rna\u021bii","Taie c\xe2rna\u021bii \xeen buc\u0103\u021bi \u0219i g\u0103te\u0219te-i \xeentr-o crati\u021b\u0103 la foc mediu conform etichetei, \xeentorc\xe2ndu-i. Adaug\u0103 o lingur\u0103 de ulei doar dac\u0103 nu las\u0103 gr\u0103sime. Pentru c\xe2rna\u021bi cruzi de porc sau vit\u0103 urm\u0103re\u0219te minimum 72\xb0C \xeen centru. Scoate-i pe o farfurie curat\u0103.","C\xe2rna\u021bii sunt g\u0103ti\u021bi; gr\u0103simea r\u0103mas\u0103 nu este ars\u0103.","",-1,B.b],t.M)
B.alx=new A.a(B.c,["\xcenmoaie ceapa \u0219i morcovul","Las\u0103 \xeen crati\u021b\u0103 doar o pelicul\u0103 de gr\u0103sime. Adaug\u0103 legumele \u0219i g\u0103te\u0219te la foc mic-mediu aproximativ 8 minute, amestec\xe2nd. Dac\u0103 se lipesc, adaug\u0103 2 linguri de lichid, nu mai mult\u0103 gr\u0103sime.","Ceapa este moale, iar morcovul \xeencepe s\u0103 se fr\u0103gezeasc\u0103.","",-1,B.a_],t.M)
B.asQ=new A.a(B.c,["Formeaz\u0103 sosul","Adaug\u0103 cele 3 linguri de past\u0103 de ro\u0219ii \u0219i amestec\u0103 1 minut la foc mic. Toarn\u0103 ini\u021bial 300 ml din lichidul p\u0103strat, pune cimbrul \u0219i dafinul, apoi \xeencorporeaz\u0103 fasolea \u0219i c\xe2rna\u021bii.","Pasta de tomate este diluat\u0103, f\u0103r\u0103 por\u021biuni lipite pe fund.","",-1,B.ab],t.M)
