B.a3o=new A.a(B.ay,["Folose\u0219te carne tocat\u0103 de porc \u0219i vit\u0103, p\u0103strat\u0103 la frigider p\xe2n\u0103 ai preg\u0103tit restul. Porne\u0219te cuptorul la 190\xb0C sus-jos \u0219i preg\u0103te\u0219te tava. Cartoful ras trebuie stors, iar p\xe2inea \xeenmuiat\u0103 trebuie presat\u0103 pentru a elimina excesul de lapte.","Bol, r\u0103z\u0103toare fin\u0103, tav\u0103 cu h\xe2rtie de copt, palet\u0103 \u0219i termometru alimentar.","Formeaz\u0103 chiftele de aceea\u0219i grosime, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 presezi excesiv. O crust\u0103 rumen\u0103 nu confirm\u0103 centrul: verific\u0103 temperatura unei chiftele mari.",B.YG,!0,"principale_4_6","25.10.2026",B.VB,u.h,"\u2022 500 g carne tocat\u0103 amestec porc \u0219i vit\u0103\n\u2022 1 ou\n\u2022 1 felie de p\xe2ine\n\u2022 Circa 60 ml lapte pentru \xeenmuiat p\xe2inea; excesul se stoarce\n\u2022 4 c\u0103\u021bei usturoi\n\u2022 1 cartof mic\n\u2022 1 leg\u0103tur\u0103 m\u0103rar \u0219i p\u0103trunjel\n\u2022 Circa 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 ulei pentru uns\n\u2022 Sare \u0219i piper dup\u0103 gust",B.a0V,B.Pe,"1. Preg\u0103te\u0219te p\xe2inea. Pune felia de p\xe2ine \xeentr-un bol cu aproximativ 60 ml lapte, c\xe2t s\u0103 se umezeasc\u0103 bine. Las-o 5 minute, apoi stoarce-o \u0219i m\u0103run\u021be\u0219te-o cu degetele. Dac\u0103 felia este foarte mare, adaug\u0103 doar c\xe2t lapte are nevoie. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: P\xe2inea este moale, f\u0103r\u0103 lapte care picur\u0103.\n2. Preg\u0103te\u0219te cartoful \u0219i aromele. Cur\u0103\u021b\u0103 cartoful mic, rade-l fin \u0219i stoarce zeama. Zdrobe\u0219te usturoiul \u0219i toac\u0103 verdea\u021ba foarte m\u0103runt. Nu l\u0103sa buc\u0103\u021bi mari de cartof \xeen compozi\u021bie, fiindc\u0103 se g\u0103tesc mai greu. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Cartoful este fin \u0219i bine scurs.\n3. Omogenizeaz\u0103 compozi\u021bia. Pune \xeen bol carnea, oul, p\xe2inea, cartoful, usturoiul, verdea\u021ba, pu\u021bin\u0103 sare \u0219i piper. Amestec\u0103 p\xe2n\u0103 se distribuie ingredientele; nu fr\u0103m\xe2nta \xeendelung p\xe2n\u0103 devine o past\u0103 foarte dens\u0103. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Compozi\u021bia se \u021bine \xeempreun\u0103 c\xe2nd o aduni cu lingura. Ai grij\u0103: Nu gusta amestecul crud.\n4. Verific\u0103 gustul printr-o prob\u0103 g\u0103tit\u0103. Ia o por\u021bie mic\u0103 \u0219i aplatizeaz-o. G\u0103te\u0219te-o separat \xeentr-o tigaie, pe ambele p\u0103r\u021bi, p\xe2n\u0103 la minimum 72\xb0C \xeen centru. Abia apoi gust\u0103 \u0219i ajusteaz\u0103 sarea sau usturoiul din compozi\u021bia p\u0103strat\u0103 la rece. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Proba este complet g\u0103tit\u0103 \u0219i gustul te mul\u021bume\u0219te.\n5. Modeleaz\u0103 uniform. Cu m\xe2inile umezite, formeaz\u0103 aproximativ 16 chiftele u\u0219or aplatizate, de circa 2 cm grosime. A\u0219az\u0103-le pe h\xe2rtie de copt cu spa\u021biu \xeentre ele \u0219i unge foarte fin cu aproximativ 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 de ulei \xeen total. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Chiftelele au grosime apropiat\u0103 \u0219i nu se ating.\n6. Coace prima parte. Introdu tava la mijlocul cuptorului \u0219i coace 15 minute la 190\xb0C. Ridic\u0103 u\u0219or o chiftea cu paleta; dac\u0103 baza \xeenc\u0103 se lipe\u0219te, mai a\u0219teapt\u0103 pu\u021bin \xeenainte de a \xeentoarce. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Baza a prins culoare \u0219i se desprinde de h\xe2rtie.\n7. \xcentoarce \u0219i verific\u0103 centrul. \xcentoarce chiftelele \u0219i continu\u0103 aproximativ 15 minute. M\u0103soar\u0103 minimum 72\xb0C \xeen centrul uneia mari, introduc\xe2nd sonda lateral. Dac\u0103 este necesar, continu\u0103 coacerea \u0219i verific\u0103 din nou. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Sunt p\u0103trunse \xeen centru \u0219i u\u0219or rumenite pe ambele fe\u021be.\n8. Odihne\u0219te \u0219i serve\u0219te. Las\u0103 chiftelele 5 minute pe tav\u0103, apoi ridic\u0103-le cu paleta. Serve\u0219te cu salat\u0103 sau o garnitur\u0103 preg\u0103tit\u0103 separat. Nu prelungi coacerea doar pentru o crust\u0103 foarte \xeenchis\u0103, dac\u0103 sunt deja g\u0103tite. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Chiftelele \xee\u0219i p\u0103streaz\u0103 forma c\xe2nd le ridici."],t.R)
B.aw5=new A.a(B.c,["Cur\u0103\u021b\u0103 ardeii","Spal\u0103 ardeii, taie capacele \u0219i scoate semin\u021bele \u0219i nervurile. Cl\u0103te\u0219te interiorul \u0219i las\u0103-i la scurs cu gura \xeen jos. P\u0103streaz\u0103 capacele dac\u0103 sunt s\u0103n\u0103toase.","Ardeii sunt cura\u021bi \u0219i nu au g\u0103uri mari.","",-1,B.b],t.M)
B.au6=new A.a(B.c,["M\u0103run\u021be\u0219te legumele","Toac\u0103 ceapa \u0219i ciupercile fin, rade morcovul \u0219i toac\u0103 p\u0103trunjelul. Cl\u0103te\u0219te orezul \u0219i las\u0103-l s\u0103 se scurg\u0103 \xeentr-o sit\u0103. Cu c\xe2t legumele sunt mai uniforme, cu at\xe2t se distribuie mai bine \xeen umplutur\u0103.","Ingredientele sunt preg\u0103tite separat.","",-1,B.b],t.M)
B.at5=new A.a(B.c,["\xcenmoaie ceapa \u0219i morcovul","\xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te uleiul la foc mic-mediu. Adaug\u0103 ceapa \u0219i morcovul \u0219i g\u0103te\u0219te circa 6 minute, amestec\xe2nd. Adaug\u0103 o lingur\u0103 de ap\u0103 dac\u0103 baza \xeencepe s\u0103 se prind\u0103.","Ceapa este translucid\u0103 \u0219i morcovul \xeencepe s\u0103 fie fraged.","",-1,B.bs],t.M)
B.aoY=new A.a(B.c,["G\u0103te\u0219te ciupercile \u0219i adaug\u0103 orezul","Pune ciupercile \u0219i g\u0103te\u0219te f\u0103r\u0103 capac p\xe2n\u0103 scade lichidul l\u0103sat. Adaug\u0103 orezul scurs \u0219i amestec\u0103 2 minute la foc mic. Opre\u0219te focul, adaug\u0103 p\u0103trunjelul, sare \u0219i piper \u0219i r\u0103core\u0219te pu\u021bin.","Umplutura este umed\u0103, dar nu \xeenoat\u0103 \xeen lichid.","",-1,B.S],t.M)
B.auI=new A.a(B.c,["Umple \u0219i a\u0219az\u0103 ardeii","Distribuie amestecul lejer, l\u0103s\xe2nd circa 1 cm liber p\xe2n\u0103 la margine. Pune capacele \u0219i a\u0219az\u0103 ardeii \xeen picioare, \xeentr-o crati\u021b\u0103 \xeen care se sus\u021bin reciproc.","Umplutura nu este \xeendesat\u0103 \u0219i ardeii sunt stabili.","",-1,B.b],t.M)
B.amt=new A.a(B.c,["Adaug\u0103 sosul \u0219i fierbe","Toarn\u0103 sucul de ro\u0219ii pe l\xe2ng\u0103 ardei \u0219i completeaz\u0103 cu ap\u0103 fierbinte p\xe2n\u0103 aproape \xeei acoper\u0103. Adu la fierbere, redu focul, acoper\u0103 \u0219i las\u0103 circa 45 de minute. Verific\u0103 periodic s\u0103 existe lichid.","Sosul fierbe lini\u0219tit \u0219i ardeii \xeencep s\u0103 se \xeenmoaie.","",-1,B.av],t.M)
B.avt=new A.a(B.c,["Verific\u0103 orezul \u0219i regleaz\u0103 sosul","Scoate un ardei, deschide pu\u021bin umplutura \u0219i \xeencearc\u0103 orezul: nu trebuie s\u0103 aib\u0103 centru tare. Dac\u0103 este \xeenc\u0103 crud, continu\u0103 fierberea cu lichid suficient. C\xe2nd este gata, po\u021bi l\u0103sa sosul s\u0103 scad\u0103 f\u0103r\u0103 capac.","Orezul este moale \xeen tot ardeiul \u0219i legumele sunt fragede.","",-1,B.b],t.M)
B.asj=new A.a(B.c,["Serve\u0219te f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 rupi ardeii","Gust\u0103 sosul \u0219i potrive\u0219te sarea. Ridic\u0103 ardeii cu o lingur\u0103 lat\u0103, sus\u021bin\xe2nd baza, \u0219i pune sos deasupra. Pentru varianta de post, nu ad\u0103uga sm\xe2nt\xe2n\u0103 sau alte lactate.","Ardeii ajung \xeentregi \xeen farfurie.","",-1,B.b],t.M)
B.PS=s([B.aw5,B.au6,B.at5,B.aoY,B.auI,B.amt,B.avt,B.asj],t.J)
