B.a3j=new A.a(B.ay,["Varianta aplica\u021biei folose\u0219te orez, nu bulgurul din sursa de tehnic\u0103. Alege ardei cu dimensiuni apropiate. Preg\u0103te\u0219te 2 linguri de ulei \u0219i circa 500 ml ap\u0103 fierbinte; cantitatea efectiv\u0103 depinde de crati\u021b\u0103.","Crati\u021b\u0103 cu capac, tigaie larg\u0103, bol, lingur\u0103 \u0219i cu\u021bit.","Las\u0103 ciupercile s\u0103 elimine apa \xeenainte de orez. Nu presa umplutura \u0219i verific\u0103 orezul dintr-un ardei, deoarece exteriorul moale nu garanteaz\u0103 c\u0103 umplutura este p\u0103truns\u0103.",B.PS,!0,"principale_4_6","25.10.2026",B.U2,u.h,"\u2022 6\u20138 ardei gra\u0219i\n\u2022 300 g ciuperci\n\u2022 80 g orez\n\u2022 2 cepe\n\u2022 1 morcov\n\u2022 300 ml suc de ro\u0219ii\n\u2022 2 linguri ulei\n\u2022 P\u0103trunjel, sare \u0219i piper dup\u0103 gust\n\u2022 Circa 500 ml ap\u0103 fierbinte, ajustat\u0103 dup\u0103 crati\u021b\u0103 \u0219i evaporare",B.c4,B.Yr,"1. Cur\u0103\u021b\u0103 ardeii. Spal\u0103 ardeii, taie capacele \u0219i scoate semin\u021bele \u0219i nervurile. Cl\u0103te\u0219te interiorul \u0219i las\u0103-i la scurs cu gura \xeen jos. P\u0103streaz\u0103 capacele dac\u0103 sunt s\u0103n\u0103toase. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Ardeii sunt cura\u021bi \u0219i nu au g\u0103uri mari.\n2. M\u0103run\u021be\u0219te legumele. Toac\u0103 ceapa \u0219i ciupercile fin, rade morcovul \u0219i toac\u0103 p\u0103trunjelul. Cl\u0103te\u0219te orezul \u0219i las\u0103-l s\u0103 se scurg\u0103 \xeentr-o sit\u0103. Cu c\xe2t legumele sunt mai uniforme, cu at\xe2t se distribuie mai bine \xeen umplutur\u0103. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Ingredientele sunt preg\u0103tite separat.\n3. \xcenmoaie ceapa \u0219i morcovul. \xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te uleiul la foc mic-mediu. Adaug\u0103 ceapa \u0219i morcovul \u0219i g\u0103te\u0219te circa 6 minute, amestec\xe2nd. Adaug\u0103 o lingur\u0103 de ap\u0103 dac\u0103 baza \xeencepe s\u0103 se prind\u0103. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Ceapa este translucid\u0103 \u0219i morcovul \xeencepe s\u0103 fie fraged.\n4. G\u0103te\u0219te ciupercile \u0219i adaug\u0103 orezul. Pune ciupercile \u0219i g\u0103te\u0219te f\u0103r\u0103 capac p\xe2n\u0103 scade lichidul l\u0103sat. Adaug\u0103 orezul scurs \u0219i amestec\u0103 2 minute la foc mic. Opre\u0219te focul, adaug\u0103 p\u0103trunjelul, sare \u0219i piper \u0219i r\u0103core\u0219te pu\u021bin. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Umplutura este umed\u0103, dar nu \xeenoat\u0103 \xeen lichid.\n5. Umple \u0219i a\u0219az\u0103 ardeii. Distribuie amestecul lejer, l\u0103s\xe2nd circa 1 cm liber p\xe2n\u0103 la margine. Pune capacele \u0219i a\u0219az\u0103 ardeii \xeen picioare, \xeentr-o crati\u021b\u0103 \xeen care se sus\u021bin reciproc. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Umplutura nu este \xeendesat\u0103 \u0219i ardeii sunt stabili.\n6. Adaug\u0103 sosul \u0219i fierbe. Toarn\u0103 sucul de ro\u0219ii pe l\xe2ng\u0103 ardei \u0219i completeaz\u0103 cu ap\u0103 fierbinte p\xe2n\u0103 aproape \xeei acoper\u0103. Adu la fierbere, redu focul, acoper\u0103 \u0219i las\u0103 circa 45 de minute. Verific\u0103 periodic s\u0103 existe lichid. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Sosul fierbe lini\u0219tit \u0219i ardeii \xeencep s\u0103 se \xeenmoaie.\n7. Verific\u0103 orezul \u0219i regleaz\u0103 sosul. Scoate un ardei, deschide pu\u021bin umplutura \u0219i \xeencearc\u0103 orezul: nu trebuie s\u0103 aib\u0103 centru tare. Dac\u0103 este \xeenc\u0103 crud, continu\u0103 fierberea cu lichid suficient. C\xe2nd este gata, po\u021bi l\u0103sa sosul s\u0103 scad\u0103 f\u0103r\u0103 capac. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Orezul este moale \xeen tot ardeiul \u0219i legumele sunt fragede.\n8. Serve\u0219te f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 rupi ardeii. Gust\u0103 sosul \u0219i potrive\u0219te sarea. Ridic\u0103 ardeii cu o lingur\u0103 lat\u0103, sus\u021bin\xe2nd baza, \u0219i pune sos deasupra. Pentru varianta de post, nu ad\u0103uga sm\xe2nt\xe2n\u0103 sau alte lactate. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Ardeii ajung \xeentregi \xeen farfurie."],t.R)
B.aop=new A.a(B.c,["Por\u021bioneaz\u0103 carnea","\xcendep\u0103rteaz\u0103 pieli\u021bele tari vizibile \u0219i taie felii de circa 2 cm, transversal pe fibre c\xe2nd este posibil. Tamponeaz\u0103 suprafa\u021ba cu h\xe2rtie de buc\u0103t\u0103rie \u0219i arunc-o. Nu t\u0103ia unele felii foarte sub\u021biri \u0219i altele foarte groase.","Feliile sunt apropiate ca grosime.","",-1,B.b],t.M)
B.arQ=new A.a(B.c,["Preg\u0103te\u0219te condimentele","Zdrobe\u0219te usturoiul \u0219i amestec\u0103-l cu cele 3 linguri de ulei, cimbrul, sare \u0219i piper. Unge feliile pe ambele p\u0103r\u021bi. P\u0103streaz\u0103 cea mai mare parte a usturoiului spre baza t\u0103vii, unde nu se arde u\u0219or.","Carnea are o pelicul\u0103 uniform\u0103 de condimente.","",-1,B.b],t.M)
B.anH=new A.a(B.c,["A\u0219az\u0103 \xeen tav\u0103","Pune feliile \xeentr-un singur strat, \xeentr-o tav\u0103 care nu este excesiv de mare. Toarn\u0103 vinul \u0219i 50 ml ap\u0103 pe l\xe2ng\u0103 carne. Acoper\u0103 etan\u0219 cu un capac sau folie potrivit\u0103.","Exist\u0103 lichid la baz\u0103 \u0219i feliile nu sunt suprapuse.","",-1,B.b],t.M)
B.bC=s([3600],t.t)
B.aoz=new A.a(B.c,["Coace acoperit","Coace 60 de minute la 180\xb0C. Scoate tava cu m\u0103nu\u0219i \u0219i deschide \xeenvelitoarea dinspre partea opus\u0103 fe\u021bei. Verific\u0103 lichidul \u0219i \xeen\u021beap\u0103 o felie mare cu furculi\u021ba.","Carnea \xeencepe s\u0103 cedeze, iar tava nu este uscat\u0103.","",-1,B.bC],t.M)
B.asc=new A.a(B.c,["Continu\u0103 dac\u0103 nu este fraged\u0103","Dac\u0103 feliile \xeenc\u0103 sunt tari, completeaz\u0103 cu pu\u021bin\u0103 ap\u0103 fierbinte, acoper\u0103 din nou \u0219i continu\u0103 \xeen reprize de 15 minute. Pulpa slab\u0103 poate r\u0103m\xe2ne mai ferm\u0103 dec\xe2t ceafa; nu \xeencerca s\u0103 o fr\u0103geze\u0219ti l\u0103s\xe2nd tava f\u0103r\u0103 lichid.","Furculi\u021ba intr\u0103 u\u0219or \xeen bucata cea mai groas\u0103.","",-1,B.u],t.M)
B.fr=s([600,900],t.t)
B.aow=new A.a(B.c,["Rumene\u0219te moderat","Scoate capacul \u0219i ridic\u0103 la 200\xb0C. Las\u0103 orientativ 10\u201315 minute, supraveghind suprafa\u021ba \u0219i sosul. M\u0103soar\u0103 minimum 63\xb0C \xeen centrul feliilor \u0219i apoi respect\u0103 odihna de minimum 3 minute; pentru fr\u0103gezire poate fi nevoie de g\u0103tire mai lung\u0103.","Carnea este p\u0103truns\u0103 \u0219i aurie, cu sos r\u0103mas \xeen tav\u0103.","",-1,B.fr],t.M)
B.avV=new A.a(B.c,["Las\u0103 friptura s\u0103 se odihneasc\u0103","Scoate tava \u0219i las\u0103 carnea 10 minute, acoperit\u0103 lejer. Aceast\u0103 pauz\u0103 dep\u0103\u0219e\u0219te odihna minim\u0103 de 3 minute. Nu o t\u0103ia imediat \xeen f\xe2\u0219ii sub\u021biri.","Carnea poate fi por\u021bionat\u0103 f\u0103r\u0103 grab\u0103.","",-1,B.x],t.M)
B.atH=new A.a(B.c,["Potrive\u0219te sosul \u0219i serve\u0219te","Gust\u0103 sosul complet g\u0103tit. Dac\u0103 este foarte concentrat, adaug\u0103 pu\u021bin\u0103 ap\u0103 fierbinte \u0219i amestec\u0103 depunerile aurii, f\u0103r\u0103 a desprinde zone arse. Serve\u0219te peste carne sau al\u0103turi, cu garnitura preferat\u0103.","Sosul este aromat \u0219i nu excesiv de s\u0103rat.","",-1,B.b],t.M)
B.YI=s([B.aop,B.arQ,B.anH,B.aoz,B.asc,B.aow,B.avV,B.atH],t.J)
