B.a3x=new A.a(B.ay,["Acest traseu este pentru felii de ceaf\u0103 sau pulp\u0103 de circa 2 cm, nu pentru o bucat\u0103 \xeentreag\u0103 de 1 kg. Porne\u0219te cuptorul la 180\xb0C sus-jos. Pentru o variant\u0103 f\u0103r\u0103 vin, \xeenlocuie\u0219te cei 150 ml cu ap\u0103 sau sup\u0103; prin coacere nu garant\u0103m eliminarea total\u0103 a alcoolului.","Tav\u0103 ad\xe2nc\u0103 potrivit\u0103 cantit\u0103\u021bii, capac sau folie pentru cuptor, cle\u0219te \u0219i termometru alimentar.","Felii de grosime apropiat\u0103 se g\u0103tesc mai uniform. Descoper\u0103 pentru rumenire abia c\xe2nd carnea \xeencepe s\u0103 fie fraged\u0103; focul maxim poate arde usturoiul \u0219i usca suprafa\u021ba.",B.YI,!0,"principale_4_6","25.10.2026",B.Vn,u.h,"\u2022 1 kg ceaf\u0103 sau pulp\u0103 de porc\n\u2022 150 ml vin alb sec\n\u2022 5 c\u0103\u021bei usturoi\n\u2022 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 cimbru\n\u2022 3 linguri ulei\n\u2022 Sare \u0219i piper dup\u0103 gust\n\u2022 50 ml ap\u0103 pentru tav\u0103; suplimentar dup\u0103 nevoie",B.c4,B.a1c,"1. Por\u021bioneaz\u0103 carnea. \xcendep\u0103rteaz\u0103 pieli\u021bele tari vizibile \u0219i taie felii de circa 2 cm, transversal pe fibre c\xe2nd este posibil. Tamponeaz\u0103 suprafa\u021ba cu h\xe2rtie de buc\u0103t\u0103rie \u0219i arunc-o. Nu t\u0103ia unele felii foarte sub\u021biri \u0219i altele foarte groase. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Feliile sunt apropiate ca grosime.\n2. Preg\u0103te\u0219te condimentele. Zdrobe\u0219te usturoiul \u0219i amestec\u0103-l cu cele 3 linguri de ulei, cimbrul, sare \u0219i piper. Unge feliile pe ambele p\u0103r\u021bi. P\u0103streaz\u0103 cea mai mare parte a usturoiului spre baza t\u0103vii, unde nu se arde u\u0219or. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Carnea are o pelicul\u0103 uniform\u0103 de condimente.\n3. A\u0219az\u0103 \xeen tav\u0103. Pune feliile \xeentr-un singur strat, \xeentr-o tav\u0103 care nu este excesiv de mare. Toarn\u0103 vinul \u0219i 50 ml ap\u0103 pe l\xe2ng\u0103 carne. Acoper\u0103 etan\u0219 cu un capac sau folie potrivit\u0103. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Exist\u0103 lichid la baz\u0103 \u0219i feliile nu sunt suprapuse.\n4. Coace acoperit. Coace 60 de minute la 180\xb0C. Scoate tava cu m\u0103nu\u0219i \u0219i deschide \xeenvelitoarea dinspre partea opus\u0103 fe\u021bei. Verific\u0103 lichidul \u0219i \xeen\u021beap\u0103 o felie mare cu furculi\u021ba. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Carnea \xeencepe s\u0103 cedeze, iar tava nu este uscat\u0103.\n5. Continu\u0103 dac\u0103 nu este fraged\u0103. Dac\u0103 feliile \xeenc\u0103 sunt tari, completeaz\u0103 cu pu\u021bin\u0103 ap\u0103 fierbinte, acoper\u0103 din nou \u0219i continu\u0103 \xeen reprize de 15 minute. Pulpa slab\u0103 poate r\u0103m\xe2ne mai ferm\u0103 dec\xe2t ceafa; nu \xeencerca s\u0103 o fr\u0103geze\u0219ti l\u0103s\xe2nd tava f\u0103r\u0103 lichid. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Furculi\u021ba intr\u0103 u\u0219or \xeen bucata cea mai groas\u0103.\n6. Rumene\u0219te moderat. Scoate capacul \u0219i ridic\u0103 la 200\xb0C. Las\u0103 orientativ 10\u201315 minute, supraveghind suprafa\u021ba \u0219i sosul. M\u0103soar\u0103 minimum 63\xb0C \xeen centrul feliilor \u0219i apoi respect\u0103 odihna de minimum 3 minute; pentru fr\u0103gezire poate fi nevoie de g\u0103tire mai lung\u0103. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Carnea este p\u0103truns\u0103 \u0219i aurie, cu sos r\u0103mas \xeen tav\u0103.\n7. Las\u0103 friptura s\u0103 se odihneasc\u0103. Scoate tava \u0219i las\u0103 carnea 10 minute, acoperit\u0103 lejer. Aceast\u0103 pauz\u0103 dep\u0103\u0219e\u0219te odihna minim\u0103 de 3 minute. Nu o t\u0103ia imediat \xeen f\xe2\u0219ii sub\u021biri. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Carnea poate fi por\u021bionat\u0103 f\u0103r\u0103 grab\u0103.\n8. Potrive\u0219te sosul \u0219i serve\u0219te. Gust\u0103 sosul complet g\u0103tit. Dac\u0103 este foarte concentrat, adaug\u0103 pu\u021bin\u0103 ap\u0103 fierbinte \u0219i amestec\u0103 depunerile aurii, f\u0103r\u0103 a desprinde zone arse. Serve\u0219te peste carne sau al\u0103turi, cu garnitura preferat\u0103. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Sosul este aromat \u0219i nu excesiv de s\u0103rat."],t.R)
B.aot=new A.a(B.c,["Preg\u0103te\u0219te p\u0103st\u0103ile \u0219i aromele","Spal\u0103 fasolea, rupe capetele \u0219i \xeendep\u0103rteaz\u0103 a\u021bele dac\u0103 exist\u0103. Taie p\u0103st\u0103ile \xeen buc\u0103\u021bi de circa 4 cm. Toac\u0103 ceapa, zdrobe\u0219te usturoiul \u0219i toac\u0103 m\u0103rarul, p\u0103str\xe2ndu-le separat.","P\u0103st\u0103ile sunt curate \u0219i apropiate ca lungime.","",-1,B.b],t.M)
B.arV=new A.a(B.c,["C\u0103le\u0219te ceapa","\xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te cele 2 linguri de ulei la foc mediu, adaug\u0103 ceapa \u0219i un praf de sare. G\u0103te\u0219te circa 6 minute la foc mic-mediu, amestec\xe2nd p\xe2n\u0103 se \xeenmoaie.",u.f,"",-1,B.bs],t.M)
B.avL=new A.a(B.c,["\xcen\u0103bu\u0219\u0103 fasolea","Adaug\u0103 fasolea \u0219i ini\u021bial 100 ml ap\u0103 fierbinte. Acoper\u0103 \u0219i g\u0103te\u0219te la foc mic circa 15 minute, verific\xe2nd pe fund s\u0103 nu se usuce. Completeaz\u0103 cu ap\u0103 fierbinte dac\u0103 este nevoie.","P\u0103st\u0103ile \xeencep s\u0103 se \xeendoaie \u0219i nu sunt tari la mu\u0219c\u0103tur\u0103.","Fasolea verde se consum\u0103 bine g\u0103tit\u0103, nu crud\u0103; urmeaz\u0103 \u0219i indica\u021biile ambalajului dac\u0103 este congelat\u0103.",-1,B.u],t.M)
B.aux=new A.a(B.c,["Verific\u0103 \xeenainte de ro\u0219ii","\xcencearc\u0103 o bucat\u0103 r\u0103corit\u0103 numai dup\u0103 ce fasolea a fiert cel pu\u021bin 10 minute. Dac\u0103 este \xeenc\u0103 tare sau fibroas\u0103, continu\u0103 cu capac \u0219i pu\u021bin lichid \xeenainte s\u0103 adaugi ro\u0219iile.","P\u0103staia este aproape fraged\u0103 p\xe2n\u0103 la mijloc.","",-1,B.b],t.M)
B.asJ=new A.a(B.c,["Adaug\u0103 ro\u0219iile \u0219i las\u0103 s\u0103 scad\u0103","Pune ro\u0219iile pasate, amestec\u0103 \u0219i g\u0103te\u0219te domol aproximativ 10 minute, cu capacul \xeentredeschis. Dac\u0103 p\u0103st\u0103ile \xeenc\u0103 cer g\u0103tire, p\u0103streaz\u0103 lichid suficient. Scoate capacul complet doar c\xe2nd sunt fragede.","Ro\u0219iile formeaz\u0103 sos \u0219i fasolea este bine g\u0103tit\u0103.","",-1,B.x],t.M)
B.alB=new A.a(B.c,["Pune usturoiul","Adaug\u0103 usturoiul, amestec\u0103 \u0219i mai fierbe 1 minut la foc mic. Gust\u0103 \u0219i potrive\u0219te sarea \u0219i piperul. Dac\u0103 sosul este prea gros, adaug\u0103 pu\u021bin\u0103 ap\u0103 fierbinte.","Sosul \xeembrac\u0103 p\u0103st\u0103ile \u0219i are arom\u0103 de usturoi.","",-1,B.ab],t.M)
B.amY=new A.a(B.c,["\xcencheie cu m\u0103rar","Opre\u0219te focul \u0219i presar\u0103 m\u0103rarul. Amestec\u0103 u\u0219or, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 rupi p\u0103st\u0103ile, \u0219i serve\u0219te. Po\u021bi p\u0103stra pu\u021bin\u0103 verdea\u021b\u0103 pentru farfurie.","Fasolea este fraged\u0103, cu pu\u021bin sos legat.","",-1,B.b],t.M)
