B.a39=new A.a(B.ay,["Acesta este un pilaf cremos la crati\u021b\u0103, cu supa ad\u0103ugat\u0103 \xeen tran\u0219e, nu varianta la cuptor din sursa de tehnic\u0103. Alege 500 g pulpe de pui cu os. Preg\u0103te\u0219te circa 1,2 litri ap\u0103 pentru fierbere \u0219i rezerv\u0103 700\u2013900 ml sup\u0103; orezul poate absorbi diferit dup\u0103 soi.","Oal\u0103, crati\u021b\u0103 cu fund gros, sit\u0103, can\u0103 gradat\u0103, polonic, lingur\u0103 \u0219i termometru alimentar.","Puiul se g\u0103te\u0219te \xeent\xe2i, apoi revine \xeen orez. Toarn\u0103 supa cald\u0103 \xeen tran\u0219e \u0219i gust\u0103 bobul g\u0103tit \xeenainte de a decide c\u0103 pilaful este gata; nu pune carnea la fiert abia dup\u0103 ce orezul este moale.",B.a0d,!0,"principale_4_6","25.10.2026",B.VD,u.h,"\u2022 200 g orez cu bob rotund\n\u2022 500 g pulpe de pui cu os\n\u2022 1 ceap\u0103\n\u2022 1 morcov\n\u2022 50 g unt\n\u2022 P\u0103trunjel, sare \u0219i piper dup\u0103 gust\n\u2022 Circa 1,2 litri ap\u0103 pentru pui; se rezerv\u0103 700\u2013900 ml sup\u0103 pentru orez",B.c4,B.RM,"1. Preg\u0103te\u0219te puiul \u0219i legumele. Pune pulpele complet decongelate \xeen oal\u0103 \u0219i adaug\u0103 circa 1,2 litri ap\u0103, c\xe2t s\u0103 fie acoperite, plus pu\u021bin\u0103 sare. Separat, toac\u0103 ceapa fin \u0219i morcovul \xeen cubule\u021be. Spal\u0103 \u0219i toac\u0103 p\u0103trunjelul. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Carnea este acoperit\u0103, iar legumele sunt preg\u0103tite.\n2. Fierbe puiul. Adu la fierbere, \xeendep\u0103rteaz\u0103 spuma \u0219i redu focul. Fierbe domol, \xeencep\xe2nd verificarea dup\u0103 circa 35 de minute. Continu\u0103 p\xe2n\u0103 c\xe2nd pulpele sunt fragede \u0219i ating minimum 74\xb0C \xeen centru, f\u0103r\u0103 ca sonda s\u0103 ating\u0103 osul. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Puiul este g\u0103tit complet \u0219i poate fi dezosat.\n3. Preg\u0103te\u0219te carnea \u0219i supa. Scoate pulpele pe un toc\u0103tor curat. C\xe2nd le po\u021bi manevra, \xeendep\u0103rteaz\u0103 oasele \u0219i cartilajele \u0219i rupe carnea \xeen buc\u0103\u021bi. Strecoar\u0103 supa \u0219i p\u0103streaz\u0103 700\u2013900 ml calzi pentru orez; completeaz\u0103 cu ap\u0103 fierbinte dac\u0103 este insuficient\u0103. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Nu exist\u0103 fragmente de os \xeen carne sau sup\u0103.\n4. \xcenmoaie legumele \xeen unt. Tope\u0219te cele 50 g unt la foc mic-mediu \xeen crati\u021b\u0103, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103-l \xeennegre\u0219ti. Adaug\u0103 ceapa \u0219i morcovul \u0219i g\u0103te\u0219te aproximativ 7 minute, amestec\xe2nd. Pune o lingur\u0103 de sup\u0103 dac\u0103 se lipesc. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Ceapa este moale, iar untul nu miroase a ars.\n5. Adaug\u0103 orezul. Cl\u0103te\u0219te \u0219i scurge cele 200 g orez cu bob rotund. Pune-l peste legume \u0219i amestec\u0103 2 minute la foc mic, p\xe2n\u0103 boabele sunt acoperite de unt. Nu \xeel l\u0103sa s\u0103 se rumeneasc\u0103 puternic. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Orezul este distribuit uniform printre legume.\n6. Fierbe treptat cu sup\u0103. Adaug\u0103 ini\u021bial circa 500 ml sup\u0103 cald\u0103. Men\u021bine fierberea mic\u0103 \u0219i amestec\u0103 periodic pe fund. C\xe2nd lichidul scade, adaug\u0103 c\xe2te un polonic din rezerva cald\u0103. \xcencepe verificarea bobului dup\u0103 18 minute sau dup\u0103 timpul de pe ambalaj. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Bobul este aproape moale \u0219i \xeenc\u0103 exist\u0103 lichid cremos \xeentre boabe.\n7. Reune\u0219te cu puiul. Pune carnea \xeen orez \u0219i amestec\u0103 delicat. Mai adaug\u0103 sup\u0103 dac\u0103 se \xeengroa\u0219\u0103 prea tare \u0219i \xeenc\u0103lze\u0219te p\xe2n\u0103 c\xe2nd tot preparatul ajunge la minimum 74\xb0C \xeen centru. Orezul trebuie s\u0103 fie moale, f\u0103r\u0103 miez tare. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Carnea este fierbinte \u0219i pilaful este legat, nu uscat.\n8. \xcencheie \u0219i serve\u0219te. Opre\u0219te focul, gust\u0103 \u0219i potrive\u0219te sarea. Adaug\u0103 p\u0103trunjelul \u0219i serve\u0219te c\xe2t pilaful este cremos. La r\u0103cire va absorbi \u0219i restul lichidului; po\u021bi sub\u021bia cu pu\u021bin\u0103 sup\u0103 fierbinte \xeenainte de servire. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Pilaful se a\u0219az\u0103 moale \xeen farfurie, f\u0103r\u0103 lichid separat."],t.R)
B.ast=new A.a(B.c,["Cur\u0103\u021b\u0103 \u0219i spal\u0103 spanacul","\xcendep\u0103rteaz\u0103 frunzele deteriorate \u0219i codi\u021bele foarte tari. Spal\u0103 frunzele \xeen mai multe ape, ridic\xe2ndu-le din bol ca nisipul s\u0103 r\u0103m\xe2n\u0103 pe fund. Repet\u0103 p\xe2n\u0103 nu mai vezi impurit\u0103\u021bi.","Frunzele sunt curate \u0219i f\u0103r\u0103 nisip.","",-1,B.b],t.M)
B.amI=new A.a(B.c,["Op\u0103re\u0219te \xeen tran\u0219e","Pune ap\u0103 la fiert \xeen oala mare. Adaug\u0103 spanacul \xeen tran\u0219e, \xeemping\xe2nd u\u0219or frunzele \xeen ap\u0103. Las\u0103 fiecare tran\u0219\u0103 aproximativ 1 minut, p\xe2n\u0103 se las\u0103. Scoate cu o sit\u0103 \u0219i p\u0103streaz\u0103 circa 300 ml din apa fierbinte.","Frunzele s-au \xeenmuiat \u0219i au sc\u0103zut mult \xeen volum.","",-1,B.ab],t.M)
B.awu=new A.a(B.c,["Scurge \u0219i toac\u0103","Las\u0103 spanacul s\u0103 se r\u0103coreasc\u0103 suficient, apoi apas\u0103-l u\u0219or \xeen sit\u0103 s\u0103 elimini excesul de ap\u0103. Toac\u0103 grosier sau mai fin, dup\u0103 textura preferat\u0103. Toac\u0103 ceapa \u0219i zdrobe\u0219te usturoiul separat.","Spanacul nu picur\u0103 abundent \u0219i poate fi amestecat \xeen sos.","",-1,B.b],t.M)
B.arY=new A.a(B.c,["\xcenmoaie ceapa","\xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te 2 linguri de ulei \xeen crati\u021b\u0103. Adaug\u0103 ceapa \u0219i g\u0103te\u0219te circa 6 minute la foc mic-mediu. Pune jum\u0103tate din usturoi \u0219i amestec\u0103 scurt, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103-l rumene\u0219ti.","Ceapa este moale, iar usturoiul nu este brun.","",-1,B.bs],t.M)
B.aoN=new A.a(B.c,["Preg\u0103te\u0219te sosul","Presar\u0103 lingura ras\u0103 de f\u0103in\u0103 \u0219i amestec\u0103 1 minut la foc mic. Ia vasul pu\u021bin de pe foc \u0219i adaug\u0103 cei 150 ml lapte \xeen tran\u0219e, amestec\xe2nd cu telul. Completeaz\u0103 treptat cu ap\u0103 de la op\u0103rire p\xe2n\u0103 sosul este fluid.","Sosul este omogen \u0219i nu con\u021bine cocoloa\u0219e.","",-1,B.ab],t.M)
B.aqg=new A.a(B.c,["G\u0103te\u0219te spanacul \xeen sos","Adaug\u0103 spanacul \u0219i fierbe la foc mic aproximativ 8 minute, amestec\xe2nd pe fund. Dac\u0103 devine prea dens, adaug\u0103 lichid \xeen tran\u0219e mici. Sosul trebuie s\u0103 nu mai aib\u0103 gust de f\u0103in\u0103 crud\u0103.","Spanacul este cremos \u0219i u\u0219or de luat cu lingura.","",-1,B.a_],t.M)
B.auq=new A.a(B.c,["Regleaz\u0103 usturoiul \u0219i gustul","Adaug\u0103 din usturoiul r\u0103mas dup\u0103 preferin\u021b\u0103 \u0219i mai fierbe 2 minute. Potrive\u0219te sarea \u0219i piperul, apoi opre\u0219te focul. Nu este obligatoriu s\u0103 folose\u0219ti toat\u0103 c\u0103p\u0103\u021b\xe2na dac\u0103 este foarte mare sau intens\u0103.","Aroma de usturoi \u0219i consisten\u021ba sunt pe gustul t\u0103u.","",-1,B.S],t.M)
B.atL=new A.a(B.c,["Serve\u0219te, cu ou\u0103 dac\u0103 dore\u0219ti","Dac\u0103 alegi ou\u0103, pr\u0103je\u0219te-le separat \xeentr-o tigaie cu pu\u021bin ulei, p\xe2n\u0103 albu\u0219ul \u0219i g\u0103lbenu\u0219ul sunt ferme. Pune-le peste spanacul cald. Nu amesteca ou crud \xeen vas ca \xeenlocuitor pentru aceast\u0103 etap\u0103.","Spanacul \u0219i ou\u0103le op\u021bionale sunt g\u0103tite complet.","",-1,B.b],t.M)
B.SQ=s([B.ast,B.amI,B.awu,B.arY,B.aoN,B.aqg,B.auq,B.atL],t.J)
