B.ac7=new A.a(B.d4,["Folose\u0219te linte deja g\u0103tit\u0103, bine scurs\u0103, \u0219i f\u0103in\u0103 de n\u0103ut, conform listei. Nu pune linte uscat\u0103 direct \xeen compozi\u021bie. Preg\u0103te\u0219te cuptorul la 180\xb0C cu ventila\u021bie. Aproximativ 18 chiftele \xeenseamn\u0103 6 por\u021bii \xeen re\u021beta surs\u0103, nu 18 por\u021bii.","Sit\u0103, r\u0103z\u0103toare, tigaie cu capac, procesor sau zdrobitor, bol, tav\u0103 \u0219i h\xe2rtie de copt.","P\u0103streaz\u0103 o parte din boabele de linte pentru textur\u0103. F\u0103ina leag\u0103 amestecul; chiftelele fierbin\u021bi sunt mai fragile, deci ridic\u0103-le abia dup\u0103 o scurt\u0103 r\u0103corire.",B.QM,!0,"principale_4_6","25.10.2026",B.U0,"Instruc\u021biuni proprii extinse pe baza cantit\u0103\u021bilor \u0219i etapelor deja prezente \xeen aplica\u021bie; confruntate cu re\u021beta Laurei Lauren\u021biu. Nu reprezint\u0103 o testare \xeen buc\u0103t\u0103ria aplica\u021biei.",B.tY,B.ZF,"1. Scurge \u0219i m\u0103run\u021be\u0219te ingredientele. Pune lintea g\u0103tit\u0103 \xeentr-o sit\u0103 \u0219i las-o s\u0103 se scurg\u0103. Toac\u0103 ceapa, zdrobe\u0219te usturoiul \u0219i rade morcovii pe r\u0103z\u0103toarea mare. Spal\u0103 \u0219i toac\u0103 p\u0103trunjelul. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Lintea nu picur\u0103 abundent, iar legumele sunt preg\u0103tite.\n2. \xcenmoaie ceapa \u0219i usturoiul. \xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te cei 30 ml ulei la foc mediu, apoi adaug\u0103 ceapa \u0219i usturoiul. Redu focul \u0219i amestec\u0103 4\u20135 minute, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 rumene\u0219ti usturoiul. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Ceapa este moale \u0219i translucid\u0103.\n3. G\u0103te\u0219te morcovii. Adaug\u0103 morcovii, amestec\u0103 \u0219i acoper\u0103. \xcen\u0103bu\u0219\u0103 aproximativ 7 minute, verific\xe2nd des. Dac\u0103 se prind, adaug\u0103 o lingur\u0103 de ap\u0103 \u0219i redu focul. Las\u0103 apoi s\u0103 se r\u0103coreasc\u0103 pu\u021bin \xeenainte de procesare. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Morcovii sunt fragezi, f\u0103r\u0103 por\u021biuni arse.\n4. M\u0103run\u021be\u0219te baza. Pune legumele \u0219i aproximativ dou\u0103 treimi din linte \xeen procesor. Adaug\u0103 piper \u0219i condimentele op\u021bionale, dac\u0103 le folose\u0219ti. Proceseaz\u0103 scurt, apoi adaug\u0103 restul lintei \u0219i p\u0103trunjelul \u0219i pulseaz\u0103 pu\u021bin, p\u0103str\xe2nd textur\u0103. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Baza se leag\u0103, dar nu este o crem\u0103 complet fin\u0103.\n5. \xcencorporeaz\u0103 f\u0103ina. Transfer\u0103 \xeen bol \u0219i amestec\u0103 cele 40 g f\u0103in\u0103 de n\u0103ut. Ajusteaz\u0103 sarea cu m\u0103sur\u0103, \u021bin\xe2nd cont c\u0103 lintea conservat\u0103 poate fi s\u0103rat\u0103. Compozi\u021bia trebuie s\u0103 poat\u0103 fi adunat\u0103 \xeen palm\u0103; nu gusta f\u0103ina crud\u0103. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: O por\u021bie str\xe2ns\u0103 u\u0219or r\u0103m\xe2ne legat\u0103.\n6. Modeleaz\u0103 chiftelele. Tapeteaz\u0103 tava. Unge-\u021bi m\xe2inile cu foarte pu\u021bin ulei \u0219i formeaz\u0103 aproximativ 18 chiftele de m\u0103rime egal\u0103. Aplatizeaz\u0103 u\u0219or \u0219i las\u0103 spa\u021biu \xeentre ele. Unge suprafa\u021ba foarte fin, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 torni ulei \xeen tav\u0103. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Chiftelele sunt plate \u0219i au grosime apropiat\u0103.\n7. Coace p\xe2n\u0103 se leag\u0103. Coace aproximativ 20 de minute la 180\xb0C cu ventila\u021bie, pe nivelul mijlociu. Dac\u0103 folose\u0219ti dou\u0103 t\u0103vi, schimb\u0103 pozi\u021biile \xeen a doua jum\u0103tate. Continu\u0103 pu\u021bin dac\u0103 suprafa\u021ba este \xeenc\u0103 foarte umed\u0103 \u0219i chiftelele nu se \u021bin. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Marginile se rumenesc u\u0219or \u0219i chiftelele \xee\u0219i p\u0103streaz\u0103 forma.\n8. R\u0103core\u0219te \u0219i serve\u0219te. Las\u0103 chiftelele 5 minute pe tav\u0103 \xeenainte s\u0103 le ridici cu o palet\u0103 sub\u021bire. Serve\u0219te cu salat\u0103 preg\u0103tit\u0103 separat. Pentru o mas\u0103 de post, verific\u0103 \u0219i ingredientele sosului ales. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Se desprind f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 se sf\u0103r\xe2me complet."],t.R)
B.as9=new A.a(B.c,["Preg\u0103te\u0219te conopida","\xcendep\u0103rteaz\u0103 frunzele \u0219i partea tare a cotorului. Desparte conopida \xeen buche\u021bele de dimensiuni apropiate \u0219i spal\u0103 atent sub jet. Taie buche\u021belele foarte mari pentru o op\u0103rire uniform\u0103.","Buche\u021belele sunt curate \u0219i nu foarte mari.","",1,B.b],t.M)
