B.acb=new A.a(B.d4,["Separ\u0103 dinainte ingredientele pentru baz\u0103 de cele pentru topping: 4 ou\u0103 \u0219i 200 g iaurt intr\u0103 \xeen compozi\u021bie; \xeenc\u0103 1 ou \u0219i 150 g iaurt intr\u0103 deasupra. Gust\u0103 telemeaua \xeenainte de a pune sare. Porne\u0219te cuptorul la 180\xb0C sus-jos.","Oal\u0103, strecur\u0103toare, dou\u0103 boluri, tel, r\u0103z\u0103toare, vas de circa 20 \xd7 25 cm \u0219i termometru alimentar.","Scurge bine conopida \u0219i evit\u0103 un vas foarte mic, \xeen care stratul ar fi prea gros. Budinca este gata c\xe2nd centrul s-a \xeenchegat, nu doar c\xe2nd suprafa\u021ba are culoare.",B.VM,!0,"principale_4_6","25.10.2026",B.V0,"Explica\u021bii proprii dezvoltate din re\u021beta deja inclus\u0103, confruntate cu Bucate Aromate. Cantit\u0103\u021bile, por\u021biile \u0219i evaluarea consemnat\u0103 \xeen aplica\u021bie sunt p\u0103strate. Odihna de dup\u0103 cuptor se adaug\u0103 timpului de preparare.",B.tY,B.a_J,"1. Preg\u0103te\u0219te conopida. \xcendep\u0103rteaz\u0103 frunzele \u0219i partea tare a cotorului. Desparte conopida \xeen buche\u021bele de dimensiuni apropiate \u0219i spal\u0103 atent sub jet. Taie buche\u021belele foarte mari pentru o op\u0103rire uniform\u0103. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Buche\u021belele sunt curate \u0219i nu foarte mari.\n2. Op\u0103re\u0219te scurt. Pune aproximativ 1 litru de ap\u0103 la fiert cu pu\u021bin\u0103 sare. Adaug\u0103 conopida \u0219i, dup\u0103 revenirea la fierbere, g\u0103te\u0219te 3\u20134 minute. Nu o fierbe p\xe2n\u0103 se sf\u0103r\xe2m\u0103: va continua la cuptor. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Buche\u021belele s-au \xeenmuiat u\u0219or, dar \xee\u0219i p\u0103streaz\u0103 forma.\n3. Scurge \u0219i r\u0103core\u0219te. Vars\u0103 conopida \xeentr-o strecur\u0103toare \u0219i las-o s\u0103 elimine apa \u0219i aburul. \xcentre timp, tapeteaz\u0103 sau unge vasul. A\u0219teapt\u0103 p\xe2n\u0103 conopida nu mai este fierbinte \xeenainte de a o amesteca cu ou\u0103le. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Nu exist\u0103 ap\u0103 acumulat\u0103 sub buche\u021bele.\n4. Amestec\u0103 baza. \xcentr-un bol, zdrobe\u0219te br\xe2nza de vaci \u0219i rade sau sf\u0103r\xe2m\u0103 telemeaua. Adaug\u0103 cele 4 ou\u0103, 200 g iaurt, verdea\u021ba \u0219i piperul. Taie cele 5 ro\u0219ii cherry \xeen buc\u0103\u021bi \u0219i \xeencorporeaz\u0103-le. S\u0103reaz\u0103 numai dac\u0103 br\xe2nza o cere. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Ingredientele sunt distribuite, f\u0103r\u0103 ou separat \xeen bol.\n5. \xcencorporeaz\u0103 conopida. Pune buche\u021belele r\u0103corite \xeen baz\u0103 \u0219i amestec\u0103 bl\xe2nd cu o lingur\u0103. Transfer\u0103 \xeen vas \u0219i niveleaz\u0103 f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 strive\u0219ti conopida. P\u0103streaz\u0103 pu\u021bin loc p\xe2n\u0103 la marginea vasului. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Compozi\u021bia are o grosime uniform\u0103.\n6. Preg\u0103te\u0219te toppingul. Bate separat oul r\u0103mas cu cei 150 g iaurt. Toarn\u0103 uniform deasupra \u0219i distribuie cele 3 ro\u0219ii cherry feliate. Nu confunda acest amestec cu ingredientele folosite deja \xeen baz\u0103. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Toppingul acoper\u0103 suprafa\u021ba \u0219i vasul nu este umplut p\xe2n\u0103 la refuz.\n7. Coace \u0219i verific\u0103 centrul. Coace orientativ 40\u201345 de minute la 180\xb0C. Centrul trebuie s\u0103 fie \xeenchegat, f\u0103r\u0103 lichid de ou, \u0219i s\u0103 ating\u0103 minimum 74\xb0C. Dac\u0103 suprafa\u021ba se rumene\u0219te \xeenainte ca mijlocul s\u0103 fie gata, acoper\u0103 lejer \u0219i continu\u0103. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Budinca este \xeenchegat\u0103 \u0219i fierbinte \xeen centru.\n8. Odihne\u0219te \u0219i por\u021bioneaz\u0103. Las\u0103 vasul 10 minute \xeenainte s\u0103 tai, apoi ridic\u0103 por\u021biile cu o palet\u0103. Cald\u0103 este mai moale; rece, dup\u0103 p\u0103strare la frigider, se feliaz\u0103 mai ferm. Serve\u0219te cu salat\u0103, dup\u0103 preferin\u021b\u0103. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Por\u021biile pot fi ridicate f\u0103r\u0103 lichid de ou la baz\u0103."],t.R)
