B.acf=new A.a(B.aCi,["Fel Principal","echilibrat",6,u.e8,"Laura Lauren\u021biu","21.10.2026","RO","RO","assets/recipe_guides/chiftele_linte.png",B.a_4,"\u2022 2 conserve de 310 g linte g\u0103tit\u0103 la aburi, scurs\u0103\n\u2022 110 g ceap\u0103 ro\u0219ie\n\u2022 2 c\u0103\u021bei usturoi\n\u2022 300 g morcovi\n\u2022 40 g f\u0103in\u0103 de n\u0103ut\n\u2022 P\u0103trunjel\n\u2022 30 ml ulei; pu\u021bin pentru uns\n\u2022 Sare, piper; op\u021bional chimion, boia, coriandru","1. C\u0103le\u0219te ceapa \u0219i usturoiul tocate \xeen ulei 4\u20135 minute. Adaug\u0103 morcovul ras \u0219i \xeenmoaie acoperit \xeenc\u0103 7 minute, cu pu\u021bin\u0103 ap\u0103 dac\u0103 se lipe\u0219te.\n2. M\u0103run\u021be\u0219te legumele cu dou\u0103 treimi din linte. \xcencorporeaz\u0103 restul lintei, p\u0103trunjelul, condimentele \u0219i f\u0103ina; p\u0103streaz\u0103 pu\u021bin\u0103 textur\u0103.\n3. Cu m\xe2inile unse formeaz\u0103 circa 18 chiftele plate pe h\xe2rtie de copt. Unge-le foarte u\u0219or.\n4. Coace la 180\xb0C cu ventila\u021bie aproximativ 20 minute, p\xe2n\u0103 se rumenesc \u0219i \xee\u0219i p\u0103streaz\u0103 forma.",!0,"N\u0103ut; verific\u0103 f\u0103ina pentru urme de gluten.",4.9,48,"Sotare 11\u201312 min, coacere circa 20 min, plus preg\u0103tire. Timpul total nu este \xeencadrat la maximum 30 min.","Fel principal vegetal","Serve\u0219te cu salat\u0103. Cele 18 chiftele reprezint\u0103 6 por\u021bii \xeen surs\u0103."],t.R)
