B.a77=new A.a(B.aCZ,["Salate","echilibrat",2,"https://www.lauralaurentiu.ro/retete-culinare/retete-de-salate/salata-de-linte-cu-somon-afumat.html","Laura Lauren\u021biu","21.10.2026","RO","RO","assets/recipe_guides/linte_somon.png",B.a_5,"\u2022 310 g linte g\u0103tit\u0103 la aburi\n\u2022 100 g somon afumat\n\u2022 30 g ceap\u0103 ro\u0219ie\n\u2022 1 avocado\n\u2022 3 linguri suc l\u0103m\xe2ie\n\u2022 1 portocal\u0103\n\u2022 P\u0103trunjel\n\u2022 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 mu\u0219tar Dijon\n\u2022 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 miere\n\u2022 2 linguri ulei m\u0103sline\n\u2022 Piper; sare numai dup\u0103 gustare","1. Decoje\u0219te portocala \u0219i desprinde feliile f\u0103r\u0103 pieli\u021be. Colecteaz\u0103 sucul \xeentr-un bol separat.\n2. Cl\u0103te\u0219te \u0219i scurge lintea. Taie ceapa \u0219i avocado; strope\u0219te avocado cu jum\u0103tate din l\u0103m\xe2ie.\n3. Amestec\u0103 mu\u0219tarul, mierea, uleiul, sucul de portocal\u0103 \u0219i restul l\u0103m\xe2ii. Combin\u0103 cu lintea, ceapa, avocado \u0219i p\u0103trunjelul.\n4. \xcemparte \xeen dou\u0103 farfurii. Adaug\u0103 portocala \u0219i f\xe2\u0219iile de somon; serve\u0219te imediat.",10,0,10,!0,!0,"Linte deja fiart\u0103; somon afumat gata pentru consum conform etichetei.","Pe\u0219te, mu\u0219tar.",4.4,24,"Mas\u0103 f\u0103r\u0103 aragaz","Somonul afumat poate avea mult\u0103 sare. \u201eEchilibrat\u201d nu \xeenseamn\u0103 automat hipocaloric sau s\u0103rac \xeen sodiu."],t.R)
