B.a6O=new A.a(B.aCu,["Fel Principal","clasic",6,u.bj,"Laura Lauren\u021biu","21.10.2026","RO","RO","assets/recipe_guides/papricas.png",B.a_S,"\u2022 1\u20131,5 kg pui cu os, por\u021bionat\n\u2022 200 g sm\xe2nt\xe2n\u0103\n\u2022 300 g ceap\u0103\n\u2022 1 c\u0103\u021bel usturoi\n\u2022 2 linguri ulei\n\u2022 30 g boia dulce\n\u2022 40 g f\u0103in\u0103\n\u2022 1\u20132 foi dafin\n\u2022 Ap\u0103 fierbinte c\xe2t s\u0103 acopere carnea\n\u2022 Sare, piper, p\u0103trunjel","1. Rumene\u0219te puiul \xeen ulei 8\u201310 minute, \xeentorc\xe2nd. Scoate \xeentr-un vas; \xeenc\u0103 nu este g\u0103tit \xeen centru.\n2. \xcen aceea\u0219i crati\u021b\u0103 \xeenmoaie ceapa tocat\u0103 7\u20138 minute. Adaug\u0103 usturoiul \u0219i dafinul; amestec\u0103 2 minute.\n3. Adaug\u0103 boiaua, apoi imediat puiul \u0219i apa fierbinte. Fierbe acoperit domol p\xe2n\u0103 se fr\u0103geze\u0219te, men\u021bin\xe2nd lichid suficient. Verific\u0103 minimum 74\xb0C \xeen centru; durata depinde de carne.\n4. Omogenizeaz\u0103 sm\xe2nt\xe2na cu f\u0103ina \u0219i 3\u20134 linguri ap\u0103 rece. \xcencorporeaz\u0103 \xeen sos, fierbe u\u0219or \xeenc\u0103 5 minute \u0219i potrive\u0219te gustul. Presar\u0103 p\u0103trunjel.",30,60,"Lapte, gr\xe2u (gluten).",4.9,96,"Sursa declar\u0103 90 min total. Puiul de \u021bar\u0103 poate necesita peste o or\u0103 numai la fierbere.",u.V],t.R)
