B.ad3=new A.a(B.dv,["Cur\u0103\u021b\u0103 \u0219i usuc\u0103 ciupercile \xeenainte s\u0103 \xeencingi tigaia. Preg\u0103te\u0219te usturoiul pisat \u0219i p\u0103trunjelul tocat, dar p\u0103streaz\u0103-le separat: se adaug\u0103 spre final. Alege o tigaie larg\u0103; dac\u0103 este mic\u0103, lucreaz\u0103 \xeen tran\u0219e.","Tigaie larg\u0103, toc\u0103tor, cu\u021bit, spatul\u0103 \u0219i h\xe2rtie de buc\u0103t\u0103rie.","Pentru rumenire, ciupercile au nevoie de spa\u021biu \u0219i de o suprafa\u021b\u0103 bine \xeenc\u0103lzit\u0103. Usturoiul se adaug\u0103 la final, fiindc\u0103 se arde mai repede dec\xe2t ciupercile.",B.W_,"1. Cur\u0103\u021b\u0103 \u0219i usuc\u0103 ciupercile. \u0218terge ciupercile cu h\xe2rtie de buc\u0103t\u0103rie u\u0219or umezit\u0103 \u0219i \xeendep\u0103rteaz\u0103 baza uscat\u0103 a picioru\u0219ului. Dac\u0103 le cl\u0103te\u0219ti, usuc\u0103-le bine \xeenainte de a le g\u0103ti.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Suprafa\u021ba lor nu este acoperit\u0103 cu ap\u0103.\n2. Taie buc\u0103\u021bi apropiate ca m\u0103rime. Taie ciupercile \xeen jum\u0103t\u0103\u021bi. Pe cele mult mai mari le po\u021bi \xeemp\u0103r\u021bi \xeen sferturi, ca s\u0103 se g\u0103teasc\u0103 odat\u0103 cu restul. Piseaz\u0103 usturoiul \u0219i toac\u0103 p\u0103trunjelul separat.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Buc\u0103\u021bile au grosimi asem\u0103n\u0103toare.\n3. \xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te tigaia \u0219i gr\u0103simea. Pune untul \u0219i uleiul m\u0103surate \xeen tigaie, pe foc mediu-mare. C\xe2nd untul se tope\u0219te \u0219i \xeencepe s\u0103 spumeze, distribuie gr\u0103simea pe fundul tig\u0103ii.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Untul este topit \u0219i spumeaz\u0103, f\u0103r\u0103 miros de ars.\nAi grij\u0103: Dac\u0103 gr\u0103simea fumeg\u0103 sau untul se \xeennegre\u0219te, ia tigaia de pe foc \u0219i redu temperatura.\n4. Las\u0103 prima fa\u021b\u0103 s\u0103 se rumeneasc\u0103. Pune ciupercile \xeentr-un singur strat, cu partea t\u0103iat\u0103 spre tigaie. Las\u0103-le orientativ 3 minute f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 le tot mi\u0219ti. Dac\u0103 tigaia este aglomerat\u0103, g\u0103te\u0219te \xeen dou\u0103 tran\u0219e.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Partea care atinge tigaia cap\u0103t\u0103 pete aurii.\n5. \xcentoarce \u0219i continu\u0103 g\u0103tirea. \xcentoarce ciupercile cu spatula. Continu\u0103 p\xe2n\u0103 sunt rumenite \u0219i pe cealalt\u0103 parte, iar lichidul l\u0103sat \xeen tigaie s-a redus. Ajusteaz\u0103 focul dac\u0103 se coloreaz\u0103 prea repede.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Sunt fragede \u0219i rumenite, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 stea \xeentr-o balt\u0103 de ap\u0103.\n6. Adaug\u0103 usturoiul la final. Pune usturoiul pisat \u0219i amestec\u0103 aproximativ 1 minut, c\xe2t s\u0103 \xee\u0219i elibereze aroma. Redu focul dac\u0103 este necesar, apoi opre\u0219te-l \u0219i presar\u0103 p\u0103trunjelul.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Usturoiul miroase pl\u0103cut \u0219i nu este \xeenchis la culoare.\n7. Gust\u0103 \u0219i serve\u0219te. Potrive\u0219te sarea \u0219i piperul, amestec\u0103 u\u0219or \u0219i transfer\u0103 ciupercile \xeen vasul de servire.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Ciupercile au o pelicul\u0103 de unt aromat, f\u0103r\u0103 usturoi ars.",B.tK,B.YB,!0],t.R)
B.aw7=new A.a(B.c,["Taie castrave\u021bii foarte sub\u021bire","Spal\u0103 castrave\u021bii \u0219i \xeendep\u0103rteaz\u0103 capetele. Taie-i \xeen rondele sub\u021biri, c\xe2t mai egale. Dac\u0103 folose\u0219ti un cu\u021bit, lucreaz\u0103 \xeencet \u0219i sprijin\u0103 bine leguma pe toc\u0103tor.","Rondelele sunt sub\u021biri \u0219i flexibile.","",1,B.b],t.M)
B.ar5=new A.a(B.c,["Las\u0103-i s\u0103 elimine apa","Pune rondelele \xeen sit\u0103, deasupra unui bol. Presar\u0103 pu\u021bin\u0103 sare, amestec\u0103 u\u0219or \u0219i las\u0103-le 10 minute. Lichidul se va aduna \xeen bolul de dedesubt.","Castrave\u021bii se \xeenmoaie u\u0219or \u0219i apare lichid sub sit\u0103.","",2,B.x],t.M)
B.amn=new A.a(B.c,["Preg\u0103te\u0219te usturoiul \u0219i m\u0103rarul","Cur\u0103\u021b\u0103 usturoiul \u0219i piseaz\u0103-l fin. Toac\u0103 m\u0103rarul sp\u0103lat \u0219i uscat; \xeendep\u0103rteaz\u0103 tulpinile groase, dac\u0103 sunt tari.","Nu r\u0103m\xe2n buc\u0103\u021bi mari de usturoi \xeen sos.","",0,B.b],t.M)
B.apP=new A.a(B.c,["Amestec\u0103 sosul de sm\xe2nt\xe2n\u0103","Pune sm\xe2nt\xe2na \xeentr-un bol curat. Adaug\u0103 usturoiul \u0219i m\u0103rarul \u0219i amestec\u0103 p\xe2n\u0103 se distribuie uniform. Nu completa \xeenc\u0103 sarea: castrave\u021bii sunt deja s\u0103ra\u021bi.","Sosul r\u0103m\xe2ne cremos \u0219i are m\u0103rar r\u0103sp\xe2ndit uniform.","",3,B.b],t.M)
B.aq0=new A.a(B.c,["Stoarce castrave\u021bii","Ia castrave\u021bii \xeen por\u021bii mici \u0219i preseaz\u0103-i u\u0219or \xeen m\xe2ini curate sau \xeen sit\u0103, ca s\u0103 elimini excesul de lichid. Arunc\u0103 apa scurs\u0103.","Rondelele sunt umede, dar nu mai picur\u0103 abundent.","",2,B.b],t.M)
B.arg=new A.a(B.c,["Une\u0219te castrave\u021bii cu sosul","Adaug\u0103 rondelele scurse \xeen bolul cu sm\xe2nt\xe2n\u0103. Amestec\u0103 de jos \xeen sus, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 strive\u0219ti castrave\u021bii.","Fiecare rondel\u0103 este acoperit\u0103 cu sos.","",4,B.b],t.M)
B.alK=new A.a(B.c,["Gust\u0103 \u0219i serve\u0219te rece","Gust\u0103 o rondel\u0103 cu sos \u0219i mai adaug\u0103 sare numai dac\u0103 este necesar. Serve\u0219te rece; dac\u0103 masa nu este gata, acoper\u0103 bolul \u0219i pune-l la frigider.","Salata este legat\u0103, f\u0103r\u0103 mult lichid separat pe fundul bolului.","",5,B.b],t.M)
