B.ad_=new A.a(B.dv,["Spal\u0103 castrave\u021bii \u0219i m\u0103rarul. \u021aine iaurtul la rece; preg\u0103te\u0219te sita \u0219i bolul pentru scurgere.","R\u0103z\u0103toare, sit\u0103, bol, cu\u021bit \u0219i lingur\u0103.","Scurge bine castrave\u021bii. Completeaz\u0103 sarea abia dup\u0103 ce gu\u0219ti sosul.",B.WL,"1. Preg\u0103te\u0219te castrave\u021bii. Taie-i pe lung, scoate miezul apos cu semin\u021be \u0219i rade pulpa.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: R\u0103m\xe2ne pulp\u0103 ras\u0103, f\u0103r\u0103 centrul foarte apos.\n2. S\u0103reaz\u0103 \u0219i las\u0103 la scurs. Pune pulpa \xeen sita a\u0219ezat\u0103 peste bol. Presar\u0103 pu\u021bin\u0103 sare \u0219i a\u0219teapt\u0103 10 minute.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Lichidul se adun\u0103 sub sit\u0103.\n3. Preg\u0103te\u0219te aromele. Toac\u0103 fin m\u0103rarul \u0219i zdrobe\u0219te usturoiul. Scurge zerul \xeen exces din iaurt, dac\u0103 exist\u0103.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Verdea\u021ba \u0219i usturoiul sunt m\u0103run\u021bite.\n4. Stoarce pulpa. Preseaz\u0103 castrave\u021bii \xeen sit\u0103 sau \xeen m\xe2ini curate, elimin\xe2nd lichidul acumulat.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Pulpa este umed\u0103, dar nu picur\u0103 abundent.\n5. Amestec\u0103 sosul. Combin\u0103 iaurtul, castrave\u021bii, m\u0103rarul, usturoiul \u0219i uleiul m\u0103surat. Adaug\u0103 sucul de l\u0103m\xe2ie treptat, dup\u0103 gust.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Sosul este gros \u0219i omogen.\n6. Gust\u0103 \u0219i serve\u0219te. Potrive\u0219te sarea \u0219i piperul. Serve\u0219te ca aperitiv sau sos; p\u0103streaz\u0103 acoperit la frigider p\xe2n\u0103 la mas\u0103.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Gustul este echilibrat, f\u0103r\u0103 zeam\u0103 separat\u0103 abundent\u0103.",B.XJ,B.T5,!0],t.R)
