B.acZ=new A.a(B.dv,["Spal\u0103 \u0219i usuc\u0103 frunzele \u0219i m\u0103rul. M\u0103soar\u0103 vinegreta \xeenainte de amestecare. Nu este nevoie de g\u0103tire.","Bol mare, cu\u021bit, toc\u0103tor, linguri pentru salat\u0103.","Adaug\u0103 vinegreta aproape de servire, pentru a p\u0103stra frunzele crocante.",B.Pb,"1. Preg\u0103te\u0219te frunzele. Rupe frunzele sp\u0103late \xeen buc\u0103\u021bi u\u0219or de m\xe2ncat \u0219i usuc\u0103-le bine. Pune-le \xeentr-un bol \xeenc\u0103p\u0103tor.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Pe fundul bolului nu se adun\u0103 ap\u0103.\n2. Feliaz\u0103 m\u0103rul. Taie m\u0103rul, p\u0103str\xe2nd coaja. \xcendep\u0103rteaz\u0103 cotorul \u0219i semin\u021bele, apoi f\u0103 felii sub\u021biri.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Feliile au grosimi apropiate.\n3. Adaug\u0103 l\u0103m\xe2ia. Strope\u0219te feliile cu sucul de l\u0103m\xe2ie m\u0103surat \u0219i \xeentoarce-le u\u0219or.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Suprafa\u021ba feliilor este umezit\u0103.\n4. Combin\u0103 ingredientele. Pune peste frunze m\u0103rul, meri\u0219oarele, nucile tocate \u0219i miezul semin\u021belor de floarea-soarelui.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Ingredientele sunt distribuite \xeen bol.\n5. Adaug\u0103 vinegreta. Toarn\u0103 vinegreta m\u0103surat\u0103 \u0219i \xeentoarce salata delicat, ridic\xe2nd frunzele de jos.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Frunzele au un strat sub\u021bire de sos.\n6. \xcemparte \u0219i serve\u0219te. Distribuie salata \xeen cele 6 por\u021bii ale re\u021betei, \xeemp\u0103r\u021bind \u0219i nucile, semin\u021bele \u0219i m\u0103rul. Serve\u0219te imediat.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Por\u021biile con\u021bin toate ingredientele, nu doar frunze.",B.RL,B.u5,!0],t.R)
