B.ayn=new A.a(B.l,["Fierbe afum\u0103tura",0,B.bC,"","Porne\u0219te afum\u0103tura \xeen 3 l ap\u0103, adun\u0103 spuma \u0219i fierbe bl\xe2nd p\xe2n\u0103 se fr\u0103geze\u0219te \u0219i este g\u0103tit\u0103. \xcencepe verificarea orientativ dup\u0103 60 de minute. Verific\u0103 minimum 74\xb0C cu termometrul \xeen partea indicat\u0103, f\u0103r\u0103 atingerea osului sau a vasului.",""],t.M)
