B.acl=new A.a(B.cg,["\u2022 4 ou\u0103 mari\n\u2022 180 g zah\u0103r\n\u2022 220 g f\u0103in\u0103\n\u2022 60 ml ulei\n\u2022 250 g vi\u0219ine f\u0103r\u0103 s\xe2mburi, bine scurse\n\u2022 5 g praf de copt\n\u2022 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 vanilie\n\u2022 1 praf de sare",u.Z,u.c,"Fructele bine scurse reduc riscul unui strat cleios.",B.YM,!0,"deserturi_4_8","26.10.2026","Ou\u0103, lapte \u0219i gr\xe2u (gluten).",B.Vp,"Variant\u0103 redactat\u0103 pentru aplica\u021bie; referin\u021ba documenteaz\u0103 tehnica, nu certific\u0103 aceast\u0103 formul\u0103. Sursa include iaurt; aceast\u0103 formul\u0103 nu con\u021bine iaurt. Ilustra\u021bii AI orientative; nu avem testare fizic\u0103 proprie.","assets/recipe_guides/desert48_01.webp",B.dU,B.np,"1. Preg\u0103te\u0219te fructele. \xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te la 175\xb0C \u0219i tapeteaz\u0103 tava. Verific\u0103 fiecare vi\u0219in\u0103 de s\xe2mburi. Decongeleaz\u0103 la frigider fructele congelate, scurge \u0219i tamponeaz\u0103 sucul. Reper: Fructele nu las\u0103 balt\u0103 de suc.\n2. Spumeaz\u0103 ou\u0103le. Mixeaz\u0103 ou\u0103le \xeentregi cu zah\u0103rul \u0219i sarea p\xe2n\u0103 sunt palide \u0219i foarte voluminoase. Ridic\u0103 telul pentru a observa urma. Reper: Spuma cade \xeen panglic\u0103 \u0219i urma rezist\u0103 c\xe2teva secunde.\n3. Adaug\u0103 uleiul. Toarn\u0103 uleiul \xeen fir sub\u021bire \u0219i vanilia, amestec\xe2nd la vitez\u0103 mic\u0103 doar pentru \xeencorporare. Reper: Uleiul nu r\u0103m\xe2ne separat.\n4. \xcencorporeaz\u0103 f\u0103ina. Cerne f\u0103ina amestecat\u0103 cu praful de copt. \xcencorporeaz\u0103 \xeen 3 tran\u0219e cu spatula, ridic\xe2nd de jos \xeen sus. Reper: Nu mai vezi f\u0103in\u0103 uscat\u0103, iar spuma r\u0103m\xe2ne aerat\u0103.\n5. Distribuie vi\u0219inele. Pune jum\u0103tate de aluat \u0219i jum\u0103tate de fructe, apoi repet\u0103. Nu \xeenghesui vi\u0219inele \xeen centru \u0219i nu umple tava peste dou\u0103 treimi. Reper: Fructele sunt r\u0103sp\xe2ndite \xeen aluat.\n6. Coace. Coace orientativ 45 de minute la 175\xb0C. Verific\u0103 centrul \xeentr-un loc f\u0103r\u0103 fruct; dac\u0103 apare aluat crud, mai coace \xeen reprize de 5 minute. Reper: Suprafa\u021ba este rumenit\u0103 \u0219i frig\u0103ruia f\u0103r\u0103 aluat crud.\n7. R\u0103core\u0219te. A\u0219teapt\u0103 10 minute \xeen tav\u0103, apoi ridic\u0103 cu h\xe2rtia \u0219i las\u0103 pe gr\u0103tar. Reper: Checul \xee\u0219i men\u021bine forma.\n8. Por\u021bioneaz\u0103. Taie dup\u0103 r\u0103cire cu un cu\u021bit zim\u021bat. Sucul vi\u0219inelor poate colora miezul, dar nu trebuie s\u0103 existe past\u0103 crud\u0103 \xeen jurul lor. Reper: Feliile sunt stabile, cu miez copt."],t.R)
