B.act=new A.a(B.cg,["\u2022 3 ou\u0103 mari\n\u2022 150 g zah\u0103r\n\u2022 200 g f\u0103in\u0103\n\u2022 100 g unt topit \u0219i r\u0103corit\n\u2022 50 g iaurt simplu\n\u2022 20 g semin\u021be de mac\n\u2022 30 ml suc de l\u0103m\xe2ie\n\u2022 Coaja de la 1 l\u0103m\xe2ie sp\u0103lat\u0103, potrivit\u0103 pentru consum\n\u2022 5 g praf de copt\n\u2022 1 praf de sare",u.Z,u.c,"M\u0103soar\u0103 sucul: l\u0103m\xe2ile difer\u0103 mult ca m\u0103rime.",B.YL,!0,"deserturi_4_8","26.10.2026","Ou\u0103, lapte \u0219i gr\xe2u (gluten).",B.Va,"Variant\u0103 redactat\u0103 pentru aplica\u021bie; referin\u021ba documenteaz\u0103 tehnica, nu certific\u0103 aceast\u0103 formul\u0103. Praful de copt a fost ad\u0103ugat explicit; propor\u021biile difer\u0103 de referin\u021b\u0103. Ilustra\u021bii AI orientative; nu avem testare fizic\u0103 proprie.","assets/recipe_guides/desert48_02.webp",B.dU,B.Wm,"1. Preg\u0103te\u0219te aromele. \xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te la 175\xb0C \u0219i tapeteaz\u0103 tava. Rade numai partea galben\u0103 a cojii. M\u0103soar\u0103 separat 30 ml suc \u0219i las\u0103 untul topit s\u0103 devin\u0103 c\u0103ldu\u021b. Reper: Nu ai partea alb\u0103 amar\u0103 a cojii, iar untul nu este fierbinte.\n2. Spumeaz\u0103 ou\u0103le. Bate ou\u0103le cu zah\u0103rul \u0219i sarea p\xe2n\u0103 cresc \xeen volum \u0219i devin palide. Reper: Telul las\u0103 o urm\u0103 scurt\u0103 la suprafa\u021b\u0103.\n3. Adaug\u0103 lichidele. \xcencorporeaz\u0103 iaurtul, untul treptat, sucul \u0219i coaja de l\u0103m\xe2ie, amestec\xe2nd u\u0219or. Reper: Compozi\u021bia este omogen\u0103.\n4. Adaug\u0103 f\u0103ina \u0219i macul. Amestec\u0103 f\u0103ina cu praful de copt \u0219i macul. \xcencorporeaz\u0103 cu spatula numai p\xe2n\u0103 dispare f\u0103ina uscat\u0103. Reper: Aluatul este gros, dar poate fi turnat.\n5. Umple tava. Toarn\u0103 \u0219i niveleaz\u0103 aluatul f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 umpli tava peste dou\u0103 treimi. Reper: Suprafa\u021ba este aproximativ dreapt\u0103.\n6. Coace. Coace aproximativ 40 de minute la 175\xb0C. Verific\u0103 centrul \u0219i mai coace \xeen reprize de 5 minute dac\u0103 frig\u0103ruia are aluat crud. Reper: Centrul este p\u0103truns \u0219i revine u\u0219or la atingere.\n7. R\u0103core\u0219te. A\u0219teapt\u0103 10 minute \xeen tav\u0103, apoi scoate pe gr\u0103tar \u0219i las\u0103 la r\u0103cit. Reper: Checul poate fi mutat f\u0103r\u0103 rupere.\n8. Taie felii. Taie checul r\u0103corit cu un cu\u021bit zim\u021bat, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103-l presezi. Reper: Macul este distribuit uniform \xeen miezul copt."],t.R)
