B.acu=new A.a(B.cg,["\u2022 150 g unt\n\u2022 200 g zah\u0103r\n\u2022 3 ou\u0103 mari\n\u2022 60 g cacao\n\u2022 100 g f\u0103in\u0103\n\u2022 100 g nuc\u0103 tocat\u0103\n\u2022 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 vanilie\n\u2022 1 praf de sare",u.Z,"Tav\u0103 de 20 \xd7 20 cm, h\xe2rtie de copt, cr\u0103ticioar\u0103, bol, tel \u0219i spatul\u0103.","Aceast\u0103 negres\u0103 dens\u0103 nu folose\u0219te praf de copt; alte formule pot folosi.",B.Zk,!0,"deserturi_4_8","26.10.2026","Ou\u0103, lapte, gr\xe2u (gluten) \u0219i nuc\u0103.",B.Uv,"Variant\u0103 redactat\u0103 pentru aplica\u021bie; referin\u021ba documenteaz\u0103 tehnica, nu certific\u0103 aceast\u0103 formul\u0103. Sursa este referin\u021b\u0103 de tehnic\u0103 brownie, nu aceea\u0219i formul\u0103; aici nu exist\u0103 arahide. Ilustra\u021bii AI orientative; nu avem testare fizic\u0103 proprie.","assets/recipe_guides/desert48_03.webp",B.dU,B.VI,"1. Preg\u0103te\u0219te tava. \xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te la 175\xb0C. Tapeteaz\u0103 tava, l\u0103s\xe2nd margini de h\xe2rtie pentru ridicare. Toac\u0103 nuca \u0219i cerne f\u0103ina. Reper: Ingredientele sunt m\u0103surate.\n2. F\u0103 pasta de cacao. Tope\u0219te untul la foc mic. Opre\u0219te focul \u0219i adaug\u0103 zah\u0103rul, cacaua \u0219i sarea, amestec\xe2nd. Las\u0103 s\u0103 devin\u0103 c\u0103ldu\u021b. Reper: Pasta nu are pudr\u0103 uscat\u0103 \u0219i nu este fierbinte.\n3. Adaug\u0103 ou\u0103le. Mut\u0103 pasta \xeen bol \u0219i \xeencorporeaz\u0103 ou\u0103le pe r\xe2nd, apoi vanilia, cu telul. Nu bate spum\u0103. Reper: Compozi\u021bia este omogen\u0103 \u0219i lucioas\u0103.\n4. Adaug\u0103 f\u0103ina \u0219i nuca. \xcencorporeaz\u0103 f\u0103ina cu spatula, apoi nuca. Opre\u0219te c\xe2nd nu mai exist\u0103 zone uscate. Reper: Nuca este distribuit\u0103 \xeen aluatul dens.\n5. Niveleaz\u0103. \xcentinde aluatul p\xe2n\u0103 \xeen col\u021burile t\u0103vii. Reper: Stratul are grosime uniform\u0103.\n6. Coace. Coace orientativ 25 de minute la 175\xb0C. Verific\u0103 centrul: frig\u0103ruia poate avea firimituri umede, dar nu past\u0103 lichid\u0103. Dac\u0103 e crud, continu\u0103 \xeen reprize scurte. Reper: Marginile sunt ferme \u0219i centrul nu curge. Aten\u021bie: Textura umed\u0103 nu \xeenseamn\u0103 aluat crud.\n7. R\u0103ce\u0219te complet. Las\u0103 negresa s\u0103 se r\u0103ceasc\u0103 \xeen tav\u0103 \xeenainte s\u0103 o ridici. Reper: Pr\u0103jitura este stabil\u0103.\n8. Taie p\u0103trate. Ridic\u0103 folosind h\xe2rtia \u0219i taie cu un cu\u021bit \u0219ters \xeentre t\u0103ieturi. Reper: Buc\u0103\u021bile sunt dense, cu nuc\u0103 vizibil\u0103."],t.R)
