B.acw=new A.a(B.cg,["\u2022 6 ou\u0103 mari\n\u2022 180 g zah\u0103r\n\u2022 200 g f\u0103in\u0103\n\u2022 60 ml ulei\n\u2022 300 g vi\u0219ine f\u0103r\u0103 s\xe2mburi, bine scurse\n\u2022 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 vanilie\n\u2022 1 praf de sare",u.Z,"Tav\u0103 de 25 \xd7 30 cm, h\xe2rtie de copt, dou\u0103 boluri, mixer \u0219i spatul\u0103.","Aceast\u0103 formul\u0103 cre\u0219te din spuma de ou\u0103; p\u0103streaz\u0103 aerul la amestecare.",B.Pg,!0,"deserturi_4_8","26.10.2026","Ou\u0103, lapte \u0219i gr\xe2u (gluten).",B.TI,u.ge,"assets/recipe_guides/desert48_04.webp",B.dU,B.a1b,"1. Preg\u0103te\u0219te fructele \u0219i tava. \xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te la 180\xb0C \u0219i tapeteaz\u0103 tava. Verific\u0103 vi\u0219inele de s\xe2mburi \u0219i tamponeaz\u0103-le. Separ\u0103 ou\u0103le \xeen boluri curate. Reper: Fructele nu au suc liber.\n2. Bate albu\u0219urile. Bate albu\u0219urile cu sarea, apoi adaug\u0103 zah\u0103rul treptat p\xe2n\u0103 ob\u021bii o spum\u0103 lucioas\u0103 \u0219i stabil\u0103. Reper: Spuma formeaz\u0103 v\xe2rfuri ferme.\n3. Adaug\u0103 g\u0103lbenu\u0219urile. Amestec\u0103 g\u0103lbenu\u0219urile cu uleiul \u0219i vanilia, apoi \xeencorporeaz\u0103 cu spatula \xeen spum\u0103. Reper: Culoarea este uniform\u0103.\n4. \xcencorporeaz\u0103 f\u0103ina. Cerne f\u0103ina \xeen 3 tran\u0219e. \xcemp\u0103ture\u0219te de jos \xeen sus \u0219i opre\u0219te c\xe2nd dispare f\u0103ina uscat\u0103. Reper: Aluatul este aerat, f\u0103r\u0103 buzunare de f\u0103in\u0103.\n5. Distribuie vi\u0219inele. \xcentinde aluatul \xeen tav\u0103 \u0219i distribuie vi\u0219inele pe toat\u0103 suprafa\u021ba f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 le \xeempingi p\xe2n\u0103 la fund. Reper: Fructele nu sunt \xeengr\u0103m\u0103dite.\n6. Coace. Coace aproximativ 30 de minute la 180\xb0C. Nu deschide \xeen primele 20 de minute. Verific\u0103 centrul \xeentre fructe \u0219i prelunge\u0219te dac\u0103 frig\u0103ruia are aluat crud. Reper: Suprafa\u021ba este aurie \u0219i miezul p\u0103truns.\n7. R\u0103core\u0219te. A\u0219az\u0103 tava pe gr\u0103tar \u0219i las\u0103 pr\u0103jitura s\u0103 se r\u0103coreasc\u0103. Reper: Miezul nu se mai comprim\u0103 la simpla atingere.\n8. Por\u021bioneaz\u0103. Taie p\u0103trate cu un cu\u021bit zim\u021bat f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 ape\u0219i puternic. Reper: Miezul este aerat, cu vi\u0219ine distribuite."],t.R)
