B.aco=new A.a(B.cg,["\u2022 3 ou\u0103 mari\n\u2022 150 g zah\u0103r pentru aluat\n\u2022 150 ml lapte\n\u2022 150 ml ulei\n\u2022 300 g f\u0103in\u0103\n\u2022 10 g praf de copt\n\u2022 1 kg mere cur\u0103\u021bate \u0219i rase\n\u2022 0\u201350 g zah\u0103r pentru mere, dup\u0103 dulcea\u021b\u0103\n\u2022 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 scor\u021bi\u0219oar\u0103\n\u2022 1 praf de sare",u.Z,"Tav\u0103 de 25 \xd7 30 cm, h\xe2rtie de copt, r\u0103z\u0103toare, tigaie larg\u0103, bol \u0219i tel.","Scade bine sucul merelor pentru a evita o baz\u0103 cleioas\u0103.",B.R2,!0,"deserturi_4_8","26.10.2026","Ou\u0103, lapte \u0219i gr\xe2u (gluten).",B.UJ,u.ge,"assets/recipe_guides/desert48_05.webp",B.u_,B.Yf,"1. Preg\u0103te\u0219te merele. \xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te la 180\xb0C \u0219i tapeteaz\u0103 tava. Spal\u0103, cur\u0103\u021b\u0103 \u0219i scoate cotoarele merelor. Rade pulpa pe r\u0103z\u0103toarea mare \u0219i c\xe2nt\u0103re\u0219te 1 kg. Reper: Nu exist\u0103 s\xe2mburi sau cotoare.\n2. Scade umplutura. G\u0103te\u0219te merele \xeentr-o tigaie larg\u0103 cu zah\u0103rul ales aproximativ 10 minute, amestec\xe2nd, p\xe2n\u0103 nu mai au suc liber. Opre\u0219te, adaug\u0103 scor\u021bi\u0219oara \u0219i r\u0103core\u0219te. Reper: Urma spatulei nu se umple imediat cu suc.\n3. Amestec\u0103 lichidele. Bate ou\u0103le cu zah\u0103rul de aluat \u0219i sarea p\xe2n\u0103 devin mai deschise. Adaug\u0103 uleiul treptat, apoi laptele. Reper: Uleiul nu r\u0103m\xe2ne separat.\n4. Adaug\u0103 f\u0103ina. Amestec\u0103 f\u0103ina cu praful de copt \u0219i \xeencorporeaz\u0103 numai p\xe2n\u0103 dispare f\u0103ina uscat\u0103. \xcemparte compozi\u021bia \xeen dou\u0103 cantit\u0103\u021bi egale. Reper: Aluatul este gros, dar curge.\n5. Precoace baza. \xcentinde jum\u0103tate din aluat \xeen tav\u0103. Coace aproximativ 10 minute la 180\xb0C p\xe2n\u0103 suprafa\u021ba nu mai este lichid\u0103. Reper: Baza poate sus\u021bine umplutura; dac\u0103 este lichid\u0103, mai coace pu\u021bin.\n6. Monteaz\u0103 straturile. Scoate tava cu m\u0103nu\u0219i. \xcentinde merele c\u0103ldu\u021be peste baz\u0103, apoi toarn\u0103 aluatul r\u0103mas \xeen benzi \u0219i niveleaz\u0103 delicat. Reper: Merele sunt acoperite de aluat.\n7. Termin\u0103 coacerea. Coace \xeenc\u0103 aproximativ 30 de minute la 180\xb0C. Verific\u0103 aluatul superior cu frig\u0103ruia \u0219i prelunge\u0219te dac\u0103 este crud. Reper: Suprafa\u021ba este aurie; merele r\u0103m\xe2n umede, aluatul este p\u0103truns.\n8. R\u0103ce\u0219te \u0219i taie. Las\u0103 pr\u0103jitura s\u0103 se r\u0103ceasc\u0103 \xeen tav\u0103, apoi taie p\u0103trate. Reper: Se disting straturile de aluat \u0219i mere."],t.R)
B.aup=new A.a(B.c,["M\u0103soar\u0103 ingredientele","Cl\u0103te\u0219te scurt orezul \xeentr-o sit\u0103 \u0219i las\u0103-l la scurs. M\u0103soar\u0103 apa \u0219i laptele separat.","Ingredientele sunt preg\u0103tite.","",0,B.b],t.M)
B.alq=new A.a(B.c,["Porne\u0219te \xeen ap\u0103","Pune orezul, apa \u0219i sarea \xeen crati\u021b\u0103. Adu la fierbere, apoi redu focul \u0219i g\u0103te\u0219te aproximativ 5 minute, amestec\xe2nd.","Orezul a absorbit mare parte din ap\u0103, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 se prind\u0103.","",1,B.v],t.M)
