B.acA=new A.a(B.kk,["\u2022 Aluat: 200 g f\u0103in\u0103, 100 g unt rece, 1 ou, 40 g zah\u0103r, 1 praf de sare\n\u2022 Crem\u0103: 400 ml lapte, 3 g\u0103lbenu\u0219uri, 100 g zah\u0103r, 30 g amidon de porumb, 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 vanilie\n\u2022 300 g c\u0103p\u0219uni","Temperaturile sunt pentru cuptor electric, c\u0103ldur\u0103 sus-jos, f\u0103r\u0103 ventila\u021bie. Pre\xeenc\u0103lze\u0219te cuptorul. Timpii sunt orientativi: verific\u0103 \u0219i miezul, nu doar cronometrul. Numele este p\u0103strat, dar re\u021beta include r\u0103ciri \u0219i nu este gata \xeen c\xe2teva minute.","Form\u0103 de tart\u0103 de 24 cm, sucitor, h\xe2rtie \u0219i greut\u0103\u021bi pentru copt, cr\u0103ticioar\u0103, tel \u0219i vas pu\u021bin ad\xe2nc.","Baza se coace complet \xeenainte de umplere.",B.a_X,!0,"deserturi_4_8","26.10.2026","Ou\u0103, lapte \u0219i gr\xe2u (gluten).",B.UW,"Variant\u0103 redactat\u0103 pentru aplica\u021bie; referin\u021ba documenteaz\u0103 tehnica, nu certific\u0103 aceast\u0103 formul\u0103. Completate coacerea \xeen orb \u0219i fierberea amidonului. Ilustra\u021bii AI orientative; nu avem testare fizic\u0103 proprie.","assets/recipe_guides/desert48_07.webp",B.SY,B.WR,"1. Preg\u0103te\u0219te ingredientele. C\xe2nt\u0103re\u0219te separat ingredientele aluatului \u0219i cremei. Taie untul rece cubule\u021be. Spal\u0103 \u0219i usuc\u0103 bine c\u0103p\u0219unile; \u021bine-le reci. Reper: Ingredientele sunt separate pe componente.\n2. Leag\u0103 aluatul. Freac\u0103 f\u0103ina, sarea \u0219i untul \xeentre degete p\xe2n\u0103 seam\u0103n\u0103 cu firimituri. Adaug\u0103 zah\u0103rul \u0219i oul. Adun\u0103 rapid \xeentr-un disc; dac\u0103 nu se leag\u0103, adaug\u0103 numai c\xe2te o linguri\u021b\u0103 de ap\u0103 rece. Reper: Aluatul se \u021bine la str\xe2ngere, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 fie elastic. Aten\u021bie: Nu fr\u0103m\xe2nta \xeendelung.\n3. R\u0103ce\u0219te aluatul. \xcenvele\u0219te discul \u0219i \u021bine-l 30 de minute la frigider. \xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te cuptorul la 180\xb0C. Reper: Aluatul este rece \u0219i mai u\u0219or de \xeentins.\n4. Tapeteaz\u0103 forma. \xcentinde la 3\u20134 mm \u0219i a\u0219az\u0103 \xeen form\u0103 f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 tragi de aluat. \xcen\u021beap\u0103 baza \u0219i pune h\xe2rtie cu greut\u0103\u021bi de copt. Reper: H\xe2rtia \u0219i greut\u0103\u021bile sus\u021bin baza \u0219i marginile.\n5. Coace baza. Coace 15 minute la 180\xb0C, apoi \xeendep\u0103rteaz\u0103 cu grij\u0103 h\xe2rtia \u0219i greut\u0103\u021bile. Mai coace aproximativ 10 minute p\xe2n\u0103 baza este uscat\u0103 \u0219i aurie. Las\u0103 la r\u0103cit. Reper: Nu mai exist\u0103 aluat crud sau umed \xeen centru. Aten\u021bie: Cronometrul este pentru prima etap\u0103; urmeaz\u0103 coacerea f\u0103r\u0103 greut\u0103\u021bi.\n6. Preg\u0103te\u0219te crema. Amestec\u0103 g\u0103lbenu\u0219urile, zah\u0103rul \u0219i amidonul cu 80 ml din laptele rece. \xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te restul laptelui p\xe2n\u0103 abure\u0219te \u0219i toarn\u0103 treptat peste amestec, b\u0103t\xe2nd continuu. Reper: Amestecul este neted, f\u0103r\u0103 bulg\u0103ri de amidon.\n7. Fierbe crema. Pune totul \xeen crati\u021b\u0103 pe foc mediu-mic \u0219i amestec\u0103 permanent, inclusiv pe fund. C\xe2nd se \xeengroa\u0219\u0103 \u0219i apar primele bule, mai fierbe 1 minut amestec\xe2nd. Opre\u0219te \u0219i adaug\u0103 vanilia. Reper: Crema este groas\u0103, neted\u0103 \u0219i f\u0103r\u0103 gust de amidon crud.\n8. R\u0103ce\u0219te separat. \xcentinde crema \xeentr-un vas curat pu\u021bin ad\xe2nc \u0219i acoper\u0103 suprafa\u021ba cu folie potrivit\u0103 pentru alimente calde. R\u0103ce\u0219te prompt \u0219i pune la frigider; nu o l\u0103sa afar\u0103 peste 2 ore. Reper: Baza \u0219i crema sunt reci \xeenainte de montare.\n9. Umple baza. Omogenizeaz\u0103 crema rece u\u0219or cu telul \u0219i \xeentinde-o \xeen baza coapt\u0103 \u0219i rece. Reper: Stratul de crem\u0103 este uniform.\n10. Adaug\u0103 fructele. Taie c\u0103p\u0219unile \u0219i distribuie-le deasupra. R\u0103ce\u0219te tarta aproximativ 2 ore la frigider \xeenainte s\u0103 por\u021bionezi. Reper: Crema este rece \u0219i por\u021bia \xee\u0219i p\u0103streaz\u0103 forma.","30 min r\u0103cire aluat + r\u0103cire baz\u0103 \u0219i crem\u0103 + minimum 2 ore la frigider dup\u0103 montare."],t.R)
B.aln=new A.a(B.c,["Preg\u0103te\u0219te tava \u0219i fructele","\xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te la 180\xb0C \u0219i tapeteaz\u0103 tava. Spal\u0103 \u0219i usuc\u0103 afinele. Folose\u0219te afinele congelate direct, f\u0103r\u0103 ghea\u021b\u0103 liber\u0103; timpul poate cre\u0219te.","Fructele nu au ap\u0103 liber\u0103.","",0,B.b],t.M)
