B.acr=new A.a(B.cg,["\u2022 300 g iaurt grecesc simplu\n\u2022 3 ou\u0103 mari\n\u2022 200 g zah\u0103r\n\u2022 250 g f\u0103in\u0103\n\u2022 100 ml ulei\n\u2022 5 g praf de copt\n\u2022 200 g afine\n\u2022 1 praf de sare",u.Z,"Tav\u0103 de 25 \xd7 25 cm, h\xe2rtie de copt, bol, tel \u0219i spatul\u0103.","Iaurtul gros \u0219i afinele uscate ajut\u0103 la un miez uniform.",B.Xm,!0,"deserturi_4_8","26.10.2026","Ou\u0103, lapte \u0219i gr\xe2u (gluten).",B.Vv,"Variant\u0103 redactat\u0103 pentru aplica\u021bie; referin\u021ba documenteaz\u0103 tehnica, nu certific\u0103 aceast\u0103 formul\u0103. Propor\u021biile nu sunt identice cu referin\u021ba. Ilustra\u021bii AI orientative; nu avem testare fizic\u0103 proprie.","assets/recipe_guides/desert48_08.webp",B.dU,B.a0B,"1. Preg\u0103te\u0219te tava \u0219i fructele. \xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te la 180\xb0C \u0219i tapeteaz\u0103 tava. Spal\u0103 \u0219i usuc\u0103 afinele. Folose\u0219te afinele congelate direct, f\u0103r\u0103 ghea\u021b\u0103 liber\u0103; timpul poate cre\u0219te. Reper: Fructele nu au ap\u0103 liber\u0103.\n2. Bate ou\u0103le. Bate ou\u0103le cu zah\u0103rul \u0219i sarea p\xe2n\u0103 devin mai deschise \u0219i u\u0219or spumoase. Reper: Zah\u0103rul \xeencepe s\u0103 se dizolve.\n3. Adaug\u0103 iaurtul. \xcencorporeaz\u0103 uleiul treptat, apoi iaurtul, folosind telul. Reper: Nu exist\u0103 ulei separat sau cocoloa\u0219e mari de iaurt.\n4. Adaug\u0103 f\u0103ina. Amestec\u0103 f\u0103ina cu praful de copt \u0219i \xeencorporeaz\u0103 scurt cu spatula. Reper: Nu mai exist\u0103 f\u0103in\u0103 uscat\u0103.\n5. Pune fructele. \xcentinde jum\u0103tate de aluat, apoi jum\u0103tate de afine. Repet\u0103 cu restul aluatului \u0219i fructelor. Reper: Fructele sunt distribuite uniform.\n6. Coace. Coace aproximativ 40 de minute la 180\xb0C. Verific\u0103 centrul \xeentr-un loc f\u0103r\u0103 afin\u0103 \u0219i continu\u0103 \xeen reprize de 5 minute dac\u0103 mai apare aluat crud. Reper: Suprafa\u021ba este rumenit\u0103 \u0219i centrul stabil.\n7. R\u0103core\u0219te. Las\u0103 \xeen tav\u0103 p\xe2n\u0103 poate fi ridicat\u0103 cu h\xe2rtia f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 se rup\u0103, apoi mut\u0103 pe gr\u0103tar. Reper: Marginile sunt ferme.\n8. Taie p\u0103trate. Por\u021bioneaz\u0103 dup\u0103 r\u0103cire. Reper: Miezul este umed de la iaurt, dar nu crud sau cleios."],t.R)
