B.acp=new A.a(B.cg,["\u2022 4 ou\u0103 mari\n\u2022 150 g zah\u0103r\n\u2022 200 g f\u0103in\u0103\n\u2022 50 ml ulei\n\u2022 300 g mere cur\u0103\u021bate \u0219i t\u0103iate cubule\u021be de aproximativ 1 cm\n\u2022 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 scor\u021bi\u0219oar\u0103\n\u2022 5 g praf de copt\n\u2022 1 praf de sare",u.Z,u.c,"Cuburile mici se coc mai uniform dec\xe2t buc\u0103\u021bile mari.",B.SG,!0,"deserturi_4_8","26.10.2026","Ou\u0103, lapte \u0219i gr\xe2u (gluten).",B.Vy,"Variant\u0103 redactat\u0103 pentru aplica\u021bie; referin\u021ba documenteaz\u0103 tehnica, nu certific\u0103 aceast\u0103 formul\u0103. Sursa are alt\u0103 baz\u0103; aici merele sunt cuburi crude, nu piure. Ilustra\u021bii AI orientative; nu avem testare fizic\u0103 proprie.","assets/recipe_guides/desert48_09.webp",B.Wz,B.np,"1. Preg\u0103te\u0219te merele. \xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te la 175\xb0C \u0219i tapeteaz\u0103 tava. Spal\u0103, cur\u0103\u021b\u0103 \u0219i scoate cotoarele merelor. Taie cubule\u021be de circa 1 cm \u0219i amestec\u0103 cu scor\u021bi\u0219oara. Reper: Cuburile sunt apropiate ca dimensiune.\n2. Spumeaz\u0103 ou\u0103le. Bate ou\u0103le cu zah\u0103rul \u0219i sarea p\xe2n\u0103 sunt palide \u0219i voluminoase. Adaug\u0103 uleiul \xeen fir sub\u021bire la vitez\u0103 mic\u0103. Reper: Compozi\u021bia este spumoas\u0103 \u0219i uniform\u0103.\n3. \xcencorporeaz\u0103 f\u0103ina. Cerne f\u0103ina amestecat\u0103 cu praful de copt \u0219i \xeemp\u0103ture\u0219te cu spatula. Reper: Nu mai vezi f\u0103in\u0103 uscat\u0103.\n4. Adaug\u0103 merele. \xcencorporeaz\u0103 cuburile cu c\xe2teva mi\u0219c\u0103ri largi, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 le zdrobe\u0219ti. Reper: Merele sunt acoperite de aluat.\n5. Umple tava. Toarn\u0103 \u0219i niveleaz\u0103. Nu umple peste dou\u0103 treimi; coace separat eventualul surplus. Reper: Grosimea aluatului este uniform\u0103.\n6. Coace. Coace aproximativ 45 de minute la 175\xb0C. Verific\u0103 centrul \xeentre mere \u0219i prelunge\u0219te \xeen reprize de 5 minute dac\u0103 r\u0103m\xe2ne aluat crud. Reper: Frig\u0103ruia nu are aluat lipicios, iar centrul este stabil.\n7. R\u0103core\u0219te. A\u0219teapt\u0103 10 minute \xeen tav\u0103, apoi ridic\u0103 cu h\xe2rtia \u0219i las\u0103 pe gr\u0103tar. Reper: Checul \xee\u0219i p\u0103streaz\u0103 forma.\n8. Por\u021bioneaz\u0103. Taie dup\u0103 r\u0103cire cu un cu\u021bit zim\u021bat. Reper: Merele sunt moi \u0219i aluatul din jur este copt."],t.R)
