B.acq=new A.a(B.cg,["\u2022 200 g f\u0103in\u0103\n\u2022 200 ml lapte\n\u2022 1 ou mare\n\u2022 30 g unt topit \u0219i r\u0103corit\n\u2022 40 g zah\u0103r\n\u2022 5 g praf de copt\n\u2022 1 praf de sare\n\u2022 Aproximativ 10 g unt pentru uns tigaia","Folose\u0219te foc mediu-mic. Prima cl\u0103tit\u0103 te ajut\u0103 s\u0103 reglezi focul; nu presa cl\u0103titele cu spatula.","Dou\u0103 boluri, tel, polonic mic, tigaie antiaderent\u0103 \u0219i spatul\u0103.","Amestecarea lung\u0103 \xeent\u0103re\u0219te cl\u0103titele.",B.PL,!0,"deserturi_4_8","26.10.2026","Ou\u0103, lapte \u0219i gr\xe2u (gluten).",B.UX,"Variant\u0103 redactat\u0103 pentru aplica\u021bie; referin\u021ba documenteaz\u0103 tehnica, nu certific\u0103 aceast\u0103 formul\u0103. Variant\u0103 simpl\u0103, f\u0103r\u0103 fructele din sursa de tehnic\u0103. Ilustra\u021bii AI orientative; nu avem testare fizic\u0103 proprie.","assets/recipe_guides/desert48_11.webp",B.VX,B.a0i,"1. Preg\u0103te\u0219te ingredientele. Tope\u0219te cele 30 g unt \u0219i las\u0103-l s\u0103 se r\u0103coreasc\u0103. C\xe2nt\u0103re\u0219te restul ingredientelor. Reper: Untul este fluid, dar nu fierbinte.\n2. Amestec\u0103 separat. \xcentr-un bol amestec\u0103 f\u0103ina, zah\u0103rul, praful de copt \u0219i sarea. \xcen altul bate oul cu laptele \u0219i untul r\u0103corit. Reper: Nu exist\u0103 aglomer\u0103ri de praf de copt.\n3. Une\u0219te bazele. Toarn\u0103 lichidele peste f\u0103in\u0103 \u0219i amestec\u0103 scurt p\xe2n\u0103 dispare f\u0103ina uscat\u0103. C\xe2teva cocoloa\u0219e mici sunt normale. Las\u0103 5 minute. Reper: Aluatul este gros \u0219i curge lent.\n4. \xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te tigaia. \xcencinge tigaia la foc mediu-mic. Unge cu o pelicul\u0103 sub\u021bire de unt \u0219i \xeendep\u0103rteaz\u0103 excesul cu \u0219erve\u021belul \u021binut cu cle\u0219tele. Reper: Untul sf\xe2r\xe2ie u\u0219or, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 se ard\u0103.\n5. Coace prima parte. Toarn\u0103 aproximativ 50 ml aluat pentru o cl\u0103tit\u0103, l\u0103s\xe2nd loc \xeentre ele. Coace circa 2 minute f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 mi\u0219ti. Reper: Apar bule care r\u0103m\xe2n deschise \u0219i marginile devin mate.\n6. \xcentoarce. Introdu spatula complet dedesubt \u0219i \xeentoarce o singur\u0103 dat\u0103. Coace \xeenc\u0103 aproximativ 1 minut, prelungind dac\u0103 centrul nu este p\u0103truns. Reper: Ambele fe\u021be sunt aurii \u0219i cl\u0103tita revine u\u0219or la atingere.\n7. Verific\u0103 miezul. Taie prima cl\u0103tit\u0103 \xeen centru. Dac\u0103 are aluat crud, redu focul \u0219i prelunge\u0219te timpul pentru urm\u0103toarele; g\u0103te\u0219te complet \u0219i bucata de prob\u0103. Reper: Nu exist\u0103 linie de aluat crud \xeen mijloc.\n8. Continu\u0103 \u0219i serve\u0219te. Coace restul la fel, ung\xe2nd tigaia foarte pu\u021bin c\xe2nd este nevoie. A\u0219az\u0103 cl\u0103titele lejer pe farfurie. Reper: Cl\u0103titele au miez aerat \u0219i p\u0103truns."],t.R)
