B.ac1=new A.a(B.Ac,["\u2022 200 g ciocolat\u0103 neagr\u0103 cu 55\u201360% cacao\n\u2022 400 g sm\xe2nt\xe2n\u0103 pentru fri\u0219c\u0103, minimum 30% gr\u0103sime: 100 g pentru topire \u0219i 300 g pentru b\u0103tut","C\xe2nt\u0103re\u0219te sm\xe2nt\xe2na \xeen grame. P\u0103streaz\u0103 por\u021bia pentru b\u0103tut foarte rece. Aceast\u0103 formul\u0103 nu con\u021bine ou\u0103 crude sau unt.","C\xe2ntar, cr\u0103ticioar\u0103, dou\u0103 boluri, mixer, spatul\u0103 \u0219i 4\u20136 pahare mici.","Folose\u0219te procentul de cacao indicat; alte procente modific\u0103 fermitatea.",B.ZU,!0,"deserturi_4_8","26.10.2026","Lapte; verific\u0103 ciocolata pentru soia \u0219i urme de al\u021bi alergeni.",B.V2,"Variant\u0103 redactat\u0103 pentru aplica\u021bie; referin\u021ba documenteaz\u0103 tehnica, nu certific\u0103 aceast\u0103 formul\u0103. Formula veche cu ou\u0103 crude a fost \xeenlocuit\u0103. Raportul 1:2 \u0219i \xeemp\u0103r\u021birea sm\xe2nt\xe2nii 1/4\u20133/4 urmeaz\u0103 tehnica Li\u2019l Vienna. Ilustra\u021bii AI orientative; nu avem testare fizic\u0103 proprie.","assets/recipe_guides/desert48_14.webp",B.VY,B.tW,"1. \xcemparte ingredientele. Toac\u0103 ciocolata m\u0103runt. C\xe2nt\u0103re\u0219te separat 100 g \u0219i 300 g sm\xe2nt\xe2n\u0103; \u021bine por\u021bia mare la frigider. Reper: Ingredientele sunt \xeemp\u0103r\u021bite corect.\n2. Tope\u0219te ciocolata. \xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te cele 100 g sm\xe2nt\xe2n\u0103 cu ciocolata la foc mic, amestec\xe2nd p\xe2n\u0103 se tope\u0219te. Opre\u0219te imediat ce devine omogen\u0103. Reper: Nu mai exist\u0103 buc\u0103\u021bi de ciocolat\u0103. Aten\u021bie: Nu fierbe puternic \u0219i nu arde ciocolata.\n3. R\u0103core\u0219te ganache-ul. Mut\u0103 \xeen bol \u0219i las\u0103 s\u0103 ajung\u0103 la temperatura camerei, amestec\xe2nd ocazional. Nu pune la frigider acum. Reper: Crema este r\u0103coroas\u0103, dar \xeenc\u0103 fluid\u0103, nu \xeent\u0103rit\u0103.\n4. Bate fri\u0219ca. Bate cele 300 g sm\xe2nt\xe2n\u0103 rece p\xe2n\u0103 formeaz\u0103 v\xe2rfuri moi spre medii. Opre\u0219te \xeenainte s\u0103 devin\u0103 foarte rigid\u0103. Reper: V\xe2rfurile de pe tel se curbeaz\u0103 u\u0219or.\n5. U\u0219ureaz\u0103 ciocolata. \xcencorporeaz\u0103 o treime din fri\u0219c\u0103 \xeen ganache cu spatula. Reper: Crema devine mai deschis\u0103 \u0219i mai u\u0219oar\u0103.\n6. Adaug\u0103 restul. \xcemp\u0103ture\u0219te delicat fri\u0219ca r\u0103mas\u0103, de jos \xeen sus, p\xe2n\u0103 dispar d\xe2rele albe. Reper: Mousse-ul este omogen \u0219i aerat. Aten\u021bie: Ganache-ul fierbinte tope\u0219te fri\u0219ca; cel \xeent\u0103rit formeaz\u0103 granule.\n7. Por\u021bioneaz\u0103 \u0219i r\u0103ce\u0219te. \xcemparte \xeen pahare, acoper\u0103 \u0219i pune minimum 3 ore la frigider. Reper: Mousse-ul rece \xee\u0219i p\u0103streaz\u0103 forma \xeen lingur\u0103.\n8. Serve\u0219te rece. Scoate numai por\u021biile servite \u0219i p\u0103streaz\u0103 restul la frigider. Reper: Textura este fin\u0103 \u0219i aerat\u0103, f\u0103r\u0103 lichid separat.",B.W2,"Minimum 3 ore la frigider."],t.R)
