B.acn=new A.a(B.cg,["\u2022 300 g macaroane uscate\n\u2022 400 g br\xe2nz\u0103 dulce de vaci\n\u2022 4 ou\u0103\n\u2022 150 g zah\u0103r\n\u2022 200 g sm\xe2nt\xe2n\u0103\n\u2022 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 vanilie\n\u2022 10 g unt pentru tav\u0103\n\u2022 Sare pentru apa pastelor",u.Z,"Oal\u0103, strecur\u0103toare, bol, tav\u0103 de 25 \xd7 30 cm \u0219i termometru alimentar.","Pastele mai continu\u0103 g\u0103tirea \xeen cuptor; nu le r\u0103sfierbe \xeen ap\u0103.",B.R9,!0,"deserturi_4_8","26.10.2026","Ou\u0103, lapte \u0219i gr\xe2u (gluten).",B.Vm,"Variant\u0103 redactat\u0103 pentru aplica\u021bie; referin\u021ba documenteaz\u0103 tehnica, nu certific\u0103 aceast\u0103 formul\u0103. Variant\u0103 f\u0103r\u0103 stafide, cu ou\u0103 \xeentregi \xeen crem\u0103; sursa folose\u0219te alt\u0103 aerare. Ilustra\u021bii AI orientative; nu avem testare fizic\u0103 proprie.","assets/recipe_guides/desert48_16.webp",B.a16,B.WE,"1. Preg\u0103te\u0219te tava. \xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te la 180\xb0C. Unge tava cu unt \u0219i pune o oal\u0103 mare cu ap\u0103 la fiert. Reper: Tava este uns\u0103 \u0219i ingredientele m\u0103surate.\n2. Fierbe pastele. S\u0103reaz\u0103 apa moderat, adaug\u0103 pastele \u0219i amestec\u0103 la \xeenceput. Fierbe conform timpului al dente de pe ambalaj. Reper: Pastele sunt flexibile, u\u0219or ferme, f\u0103r\u0103 centru f\u0103inos crud.\n3. Scurge \u0219i r\u0103core\u0219te. Scurge bine pastele \u0219i las\u0103-le c\xe2teva minute. Desf\u0103-le u\u0219or dac\u0103 se lipesc. Reper: Pastele sunt c\u0103ldu\u021be \u0219i nu mai aburesc puternic.\n4. F\u0103 crema de br\xe2nz\u0103. Bate ou\u0103le cu zah\u0103rul \u0219i vanilia, apoi \xeencorporeaz\u0103 sm\xe2nt\xe2na \u0219i br\xe2nza zdrobit\u0103 cu furculi\u021ba. Reper: Ou\u0103le sunt distribuite f\u0103r\u0103 albu\u0219 separat.\n5. Une\u0219te. Adaug\u0103 pastele c\u0103ldu\u021be \u0219i amestec\u0103 delicat p\xe2n\u0103 sunt acoperite de crem\u0103. Reper: Crema p\u0103trunde printre paste. Aten\u021bie: Pastele fierbin\u021bi pot \xeenchega ou\u0103le prea devreme.\n6. Niveleaz\u0103. Toarn\u0103 \xeen tav\u0103 \u0219i \xeentinde p\xe2n\u0103 \xeen col\u021buri, f\u0103r\u0103 presare puternic\u0103. Reper: Stratul are grosime uniform\u0103.\n7. Coace. Coace orientativ 35 de minute la 180\xb0C. Verific\u0103 centrul cu termometrul: minimum 74\xb0C. Continu\u0103 dac\u0103 este \xeenc\u0103 lichid. Reper: Suprafa\u021ba este aurie \u0219i centrul \xeenchegat.\n8. Odihne\u0219te \u0219i serve\u0219te. Las\u0103 15 minute \xeenainte de por\u021bionare. R\u0103ce\u0219te prompt restul \u0219i pune la frigider \xeen cel mult 2 ore. Reper: Por\u021biile \xee\u0219i p\u0103streaz\u0103 forma."],t.R)
