B.ack=new A.a(B.cg,["\u2022 250 g f\u0103in\u0103\n\u2022 150 g zah\u0103r\n\u2022 25 g cacao\n\u2022 5 g praf de copt\n\u2022 2 ou\u0103 mari\n\u2022 150 ml lapte\n\u2022 100 g unt topit \u0219i r\u0103corit\n\u2022 100 g pic\u0103turi de ciocolat\u0103 sau ciocolat\u0103 tocat\u0103\n\u2022 1 praf de sare",u.Z,"Tav\u0103 de 12 brio\u0219e cu h\xe2rtii, dou\u0103 boluri, tel, spatul\u0103 \u0219i gr\u0103tar.","Ciocolata topit\u0103 pe frig\u0103ruie nu \xeenseamn\u0103 aluat crud.",B.Qp,!0,"deserturi_4_8","26.10.2026","Ou\u0103, lapte \u0219i gr\xe2u (gluten).",B.Ui,"Variant\u0103 redactat\u0103 pentru aplica\u021bie; referin\u021ba documenteaz\u0103 tehnica, nu certific\u0103 aceast\u0103 formul\u0103. Corectat numele ingredientului ciocolat\u0103; propor\u021biile difer\u0103 de referin\u021b\u0103. Ilustra\u021bii AI orientative; nu avem testare fizic\u0103 proprie.","assets/recipe_guides/desert48_18.webp",B.Sd,B.a0M,"1. Preg\u0103te\u0219te tava. \xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te la 180\xb0C \u0219i pune h\xe2rtii \xeen cele 12 loca\u0219uri. Tope\u0219te untul \u0219i las\u0103-l c\u0103ldu\u021b; c\xe2nt\u0103re\u0219te restul ingredientelor. Reper: Untul nu este fierbinte \u0219i tava este preg\u0103tit\u0103.\n2. Amestec\u0103 separat. Cerne \xeentr-un bol f\u0103ina, cacaua \u0219i praful de copt; adaug\u0103 zah\u0103rul \u0219i sarea. \xcen altul bate ou\u0103le cu laptele \u0219i untul. Reper: Pudrele sunt distribuite f\u0103r\u0103 bulg\u0103ri mari de cacao.\n3. F\u0103 aluatul. Toarn\u0103 lichidele peste pudre. Amestec\u0103 cu spatula p\xe2n\u0103 dispare f\u0103ina uscat\u0103. \xcencorporeaz\u0103 ciocolata, p\u0103str\xe2nd pu\u021bin\u0103 pentru deasupra. Reper: Aluatul este gros; c\xe2teva cocoloa\u0219e mici sunt normale. Aten\u021bie: Mixarea lung\u0103 poate \xeent\u0103ri brio\u0219ele.\n4. Umple formele. \xcemparte aluatul p\xe2n\u0103 la aproximativ dou\u0103 treimi din fiecare loca\u0219. Presar\u0103 ciocolata p\u0103strat\u0103 \u0219i coace separat eventualul surplus. Reper: Por\u021biile au m\u0103rime apropiat\u0103.\n5. Coace. Coace orientativ 22 de minute la 180\xb0C. Verific\u0103 centrul cu frig\u0103ruia, evit\xe2nd o bucat\u0103 de ciocolat\u0103 topit\u0103. Mai coace pu\u021bin dac\u0103 apare aluat crud. Reper: Brio\u0219ele sunt crescute \u0219i miezul revine u\u0219or la atingere.\n6. R\u0103core\u0219te \xeen tav\u0103. A\u0219teapt\u0103 5 minute \xeenainte s\u0103 mu\u021bi brio\u0219ele din tav\u0103. Reper: Sunt suficient de ferme pentru a fi ridicate.\n7. Mut\u0103 pe gr\u0103tar. Ridic\u0103 fiecare brio\u0219\u0103 \u0219i las-o pe gr\u0103tar, ca baza s\u0103 nu r\u0103m\xe2n\u0103 \xeen abur. Reper: Nu mai exist\u0103 condens \xeen jurul h\xe2rtiilor.\n8. Verific\u0103 \u0219i serve\u0219te. Desf\u0103 o brio\u0219\u0103 r\u0103corit\u0103: miezul trebuie s\u0103 fie copt, cu puncte de ciocolat\u0103 moale, f\u0103r\u0103 past\u0103 crud\u0103. Reper: Miezul este aerat \u0219i complet \xeenchegat."],t.R)
