B.acz=new A.a(B.kk,["\u2022 500 g biscui\u021bi simpli\n\u2022 3\u20134 banane, c\xe2t s\u0103 acopere un strat\n\u2022 500 ml lapte\n\u2022 100 g unt\n\u2022 150 g zah\u0103r\n\u2022 30 g cacao\n\u2022 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 vanilie","Nu necesit\u0103 cuptor. Adaug\u0103 sosul treptat: biscui\u021bii absorb diferit. P\u0103streaz\u0103 o rezerv\u0103 \u0219i nu o turna for\u021bat pe toat\u0103.","Cr\u0103ticioar\u0103, bol mare, spatul\u0103, form\u0103 rotund\u0103 de 22\u201324 cm \u0219i folie alimentar\u0103.","Adaug\u0103 sosul dup\u0103 absorb\u021bie, nu fiindc\u0103 trebuie utilizat tot.",B.X9,!0,"deserturi_4_8","26.10.2026",u.cm,B.UA,"Variant\u0103 redactat\u0103 pentru aplica\u021bie; referin\u021ba documenteaz\u0103 tehnica, nu certific\u0103 aceast\u0103 formul\u0103. Variant\u0103 cu sos de lapte \u0219i unt; nu reproduce crema fiart\u0103 din referin\u021b\u0103. F\u0103r\u0103 nuci sau glazur\u0103. Ilustra\u021bii AI orientative; nu avem testare fizic\u0103 proprie.","assets/recipe_guides/desert48_19.webp",B.dU,B.a0k,"1. Preg\u0103te\u0219te biscui\u021bii. Rupe biscui\u021bii \xeen buc\u0103\u021bi de aproximativ 1\u20132 cm, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103-i transformi pe to\u021bi \xeen pudr\u0103. Tapeteaz\u0103 forma cu folie alimentar\u0103 potrivit\u0103. Reper: Ai buc\u0103\u021bi vizibile \u0219i forma preg\u0103tit\u0103.\n2. Prepar\u0103 sosul. Amestec\u0103 zah\u0103rul \u0219i cacaua cu pu\u021bin lapte \xeentr-o past\u0103 neted\u0103. Adaug\u0103 restul laptelui \u0219i \xeenc\u0103lze\u0219te amestec\xe2nd p\xe2n\u0103 zah\u0103rul se dizolv\u0103 \u0219i apare un clocot u\u0219or. Opre\u0219te \u0219i adaug\u0103 untul \u0219i vanilia. Reper: Sosul este uniform, f\u0103r\u0103 pudr\u0103 uscat\u0103.\n3. Umeze\u0219te treptat. R\u0103core\u0219te sosul p\xe2n\u0103 este c\u0103ldu\u021b. Pune deoparte aproximativ 100 ml; adaug\u0103 restul peste biscui\u021bi \xeen tran\u0219e, amestec\xe2nd delicat. A\u0219teapt\u0103 5 minute pentru absorb\u021bie. Reper: Buc\u0103\u021bile se leag\u0103 la presare, f\u0103r\u0103 balt\u0103 de lichid.\n4. Ajusteaz\u0103. Dac\u0103 amestecul este prea uscat \u0219i se sf\u0103r\xe2m\u0103, adaug\u0103 c\xe2te o lingur\u0103 din sosul rezervat. Opre\u0219te c\xe2nd este modelabil; nu folosi obligatoriu tot sosul. Reper: Ai o mas\u0103 umed\u0103 \u0219i compactabil\u0103, nu o sup\u0103 de biscui\u021bi.\n5. Pune bananele. Asigur\u0103-te c\u0103 amestecul nu mai este fierbinte \xeenainte de contactul cu folia. Preseaz\u0103 jum\u0103tate \xeen form\u0103. Cur\u0103\u021b\u0103 bananele, taie pe lung \u0219i pune \xeentr-un singur strat. Reper: Bananele sunt sus\u021binute de baza compact\u0103.\n6. Acoper\u0103. Pune restul biscui\u021bilor deasupra \u0219i preseaz\u0103 u\u0219or, inclusiv pe margini. Reper: Bananele sunt acoperite \u0219i suprafa\u021ba dreapt\u0103.\n7. R\u0103ce\u0219te. Acoper\u0103 \u0219i \u021bine minimum 4 ore la frigider. Dac\u0103 p\u0103strezi separat sos r\u0103mas, \u021bine-l \u0219i pe el la rece. Reper: Tortul este rece \u0219i \xee\u0219i p\u0103streaz\u0103 forma.\n8. Scoate \u0219i taie. Desf\u0103 inelul, \xeendep\u0103rteaz\u0103 folia \u0219i por\u021bioneaz\u0103 cu un cu\u021bit curat. P\u0103streaz\u0103 restul la frigider. Reper: Sec\u021biunea arat\u0103 biscui\u021bi \u0219i banane, f\u0103r\u0103 lichid care curge.","Minimum 4 ore la frigider."],t.R)
