B.a6e=new A.a(B.d3,["echilibrat","Fel Principal",4,15,20,274,30,B.R6,u.f0,"1. Pulverizeaz\u0103 tigaia cu spray \u0219i \xeenc\u0103lze\u0219te-o. G\u0103te\u0219te puiul 3\u20135 minute, amestec\xe2nd.\n2. Redu focul. Adaug\u0103 ro\u0219iile cu suc, sosul chili, legumele, verde\u021burile, ardeiul iute \u0219i sarea. Adu la fierbere.\n3. Acoper\u0103 \u0219i fierbe domol 10 minute. Verific\u0103 \u0219i g\u0103tirea complet\u0103 a puiului.","Orezul sugerat la servire \xeen surs\u0103 este o garnitur\u0103 separat\u0103.",u.I,"NHLBI / NIH","19.10.2026",u.a1,"",!0,"20.10.2026"],t.R)
