B.a6h=new A.a(B.d3,["echilibrat","Garnituri",4,0,10,76,3,B.Py,"\u2022 aprox. 35 g semin\u021be de pin\n\u2022 567g spanac frunze, sp\u0103lat\n\u2022 aprox. 100 g stafide aurii f\u0103r\u0103 s\xe2mburi, ne\xeendesate\n\u2022 \u215b linguri\u021b\u0103 nuc\u0219oar\u0103 m\u0103cinat\u0103\n\u2022 \u215b linguri\u021b\u0103 sare\n\u2022 Ap\u0103, ad\u0103ugat\u0103 c\xe2te 60 ml, dup\u0103 nevoie","1. Rumene\u0219te u\u0219or semin\u021bele de pin \xeentr-o tigaie antiaderent\u0103, amestec\xe2nd; scoate-le \xeenainte s\u0103 se ard\u0103.\n2. Adaug\u0103 \xeen tigaie 60 ml de ap\u0103 \u0219i spanacul \xeen tran\u0219e. Completeaz\u0103 apa dup\u0103 nevoie, c\xe2t s\u0103 se \xeenmoaie frunzele. Pune stafidele la ultima tran\u0219\u0103.\n3. Adaug\u0103 nuc\u0219oara \u0219i sarea. C\xe2nd spanacul este \xeenmuiat \u0219i stafidele calde, elimin\u0103 excesul de ap\u0103. Serve\u0219te \xeen 4 por\u021bii cu semin\u021bele de pin.","Cantitatea de spanac este masa frunzelor crude, nu a spanacului deja g\u0103tit.","https://www.nhlbi.nih.gov/health/heart-healthy-living/healthy-foods/healthy-eating-recipes/baby-spinach-golden-raisins-and","NHLBI / NIH","19.10.2026","Semin\u021be de pin.","",!0,"20.10.2026"],t.R)
