B.a6k=new A.a(B.d3,["echilibrat","Fel Principal",6,10,20,196,27,B.Yd,u.aS,"1. Pre\xeenc\u0103lze\u0219te cuptorul la aproximativ 205\xb0C. Amestec\u0103 sm\xe2nt\xe2na, m\u0103rarul, ceapa, mu\u0219tarul \u0219i l\u0103m\xe2ia.\n2. Pulverizeaz\u0103 tava cu spray. A\u0219az\u0103 somonul cu pielea \xeen jos; presar\u0103 usturoiul \u0219i piperul, apoi distribuie sosul.\n3. Coace aproximativ 20 minute, p\xe2n\u0103 este opac \u0219i se desface u\u0219or. Sursa cere minimum 63\xb0C \xeen interior. Serve\u0219te imediat.","O sm\xe2nt\xe2n\u0103 cu alt procent de gr\u0103sime modific\u0103 valorile nutri\u021bionale.",u.cr,"NHLBI / NIH","19.10.2026","Pe\u0219te, lapte, mu\u0219tar.","",!0,"20.10.2026"],t.R)
