B.a6d=new A.a(B.d3,["echilibrat","Fel Principal",4,10,30,242,20,B.Rf,u.gd,"1. La cuptor: 175\xb0C. \xcen vas termorezistent, rumene\u0219te ciupercile \xeen ulei 3\u20135 minute; adaug\u0103 legumele \xeenc\u0103 3\u20135 minute.\n2. Adaug\u0103 supa; la fierbere pune puiul. Acoper\u0103 \u0219i coace aproximativ 20 minute, p\xe2n\u0103 atinge minimum 74\xb0C \xeen interior.\n3. Scoate puiul. Fierbe sosul cu verde\u021burile \u0219i l\u0103m\xe2ia. Adaug\u0103 amidonul cu sm\xe2nt\xe2na, readu la fierbere \u0219i opre\u0219te focul.\n4. Asezoneaz\u0103 \u0219i serve\u0219te sosul peste pui.","Folose\u0219te vas \u0219i capac rezistente la cuptor.",u.aq,"NHLBI / NIH","19.10.2026",u.bW,"",!0,"20.10.2026"],t.R)
