B.aca=new A.a(B.d4,["Folose\u0219te file de somon complet decongelat \u0219i ciuperci shiitake proaspete. P\u0103str\u0103m m\u0103sura de 120 ml pentru feliile de ciuperci, f\u0103r\u0103 a ghici un gramaj. Dac\u0103 alegi ciuperci uscate, hidrateaz\u0103 \u0219i g\u0103te\u0219te conform ambalajului \xeenainte de a le folosi.","Tigaie larg\u0103 cu capac care \xeenchide bine, can\u0103 gradat\u0103, cu\u021bit, palet\u0103 \u0219i termometru alimentar.","Somonul se g\u0103te\u0219te bl\xe2nd \xeen lichid aromat, nu prin fierbere puternic\u0103. Buc\u0103\u021bile mai groase cer mai mult timp dec\xe2t cele sub\u021biri; temperatura din centru este verificarea principal\u0103.",B.a_a,!0,"principale_4_7","25.10.2026",B.Uf,"Explica\u021bii proprii dezvoltate din re\u021beta NHLBI deja inclus\u0103. Por\u021biile, cantit\u0103\u021bile \u0219i valorile publicate sunt p\u0103strate. Volumul ciupercilor nu a fost transformat \xeentr-un gramaj neverificat.",B.d2,B.W1,"1. Preg\u0103te\u0219te ciupercile \u0219i aromele. Cur\u0103\u021b\u0103 ciupercile, \xeendep\u0103rteaz\u0103 tulpinile tari \u0219i feliaz\u0103 p\u0103l\u0103riile. M\u0103soar\u0103 volumul feliilor \xeentr-un recipient gradat. Toac\u0103 ghimbirul \u0219i ceapa verde. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Ciupercile \u0219i aromele sunt preg\u0103tite.\n2. Por\u021bioneaz\u0103 somonul. \xcemparte cele 340 g \xeen 4 buc\u0103\u021bi apropiate ca grosime. Verific\u0103 fileul cu degetele curate \u0219i scoate oasele vizibile cu o penset\u0103 alimentar\u0103. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Por\u021biile sunt uniforme \u0219i verificate de oase.\n3. Formeaz\u0103 baza aromat\u0103. Pune \xeen tigaie supa, ciupercile, ghimbirul, ceapa verde \u0219i sosul de soia. Adaug\u0103 uleiul de susan numai dac\u0103 \xeel folose\u0219ti. Adu la fierbere. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Aromele sunt \xeenconjurate de lichid.\n4. G\u0103te\u0219te ciupercile \xeen sup\u0103. Redu focul \u0219i fierbe domol 2\u20133 minute. Verific\u0103 dac\u0103 ciupercile s-au \xeenmuiat; dac\u0103 sunt \xeenc\u0103 tari, continu\u0103 \xeenainte de a ad\u0103uga pe\u0219tele. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Ciupercile sunt fragede, iar lichidul fierbe lini\u0219tit.\n5. Adaug\u0103 somonul. A\u0219az\u0103 por\u021biile \xeentr-un singur strat \u0219i acoper\u0103 imediat. G\u0103te\u0219te la foc mic orientativ 4\u20135 minute, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 \xeentorci continuu pe\u0219tele. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Pe\u0219tele \xeencepe s\u0103 devin\u0103 opac, iar aburul r\u0103m\xe2ne sub capac.\n6. M\u0103soar\u0103 centrul. Verific\u0103 minimum 63\xb0C \xeen partea cea mai groas\u0103 a fiec\u0103rei por\u021bii mari. Dac\u0103 nu este gata, continu\u0103 pu\u021bin la foc mic. Nu prelungi fierberea dup\u0103 ce a atins temperatura \u0219i se desface u\u0219or. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Somonul este p\u0103truns \u0219i se separ\u0103 \xeen lamele.\n7. Serve\u0219te \xeen patru por\u021bii. Ridic\u0103 fiecare bucat\u0103 cu paleta. Adaug\u0103 circa 60 ml lichid aromat \u0219i ciuperci \xeen fiecare farfurie, dac\u0103 volumul r\u0103mas permite. Orezul sau alt\u0103 garnitur\u0103 se prepar\u0103 separat. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Somonul r\u0103m\xe2ne \xeentreg, cu pu\u021bin lichid aromat."],t.R)
B.apN=new A.a(B.c,["Preg\u0103te\u0219te fileurile","Verific\u0103 oasele, strope\u0219te cu lingura de suc de l\u0103m\xe2ie \u0219i tamponeaz\u0103 u\u0219or suprafa\u021ba. Nu l\u0103sa fileurile mult timp \xeen zeam\u0103 de l\u0103m\xe2ie \u0219i nu presupune c\u0103 aceasta g\u0103te\u0219te pe\u0219tele.","Fileurile sunt verificate \u0219i nu picur\u0103.","",-1,B.b],t.M)
