B.acd=new A.a(B.d4,["Alege cartofi noi mici spre medii, apropia\u021bi ca m\u0103rime, f\u0103r\u0103 zone verzi. Traseul de mai jos folose\u0219te jum\u0103t\u0103\u021bi scobite, cu pere\u021bi de circa 7\u201310 mm; cartofii mari \xeentregi cer alt timp. Porne\u0219te cuptorul la 180\xb0C cu ventila\u021bie.","Perie pentru legume, cu\u021bit, linguri\u021b\u0103 sau dispozitiv de scobit, bol, r\u0103z\u0103toare, tav\u0103 \u0219i termometru alimentar.","Verific\u0103 separat cartoful \u0219i umplutura. Dac\u0103 suprafa\u021ba s-a rumenit, dar cartoful \xeenc\u0103 este tare, acoper\u0103 lejer \u0219i continu\u0103 coacerea; nu opri automat dup\u0103 30 de minute.",B.PU,!0,"principale_4_7","25.10.2026",B.U3,"Explica\u021bii proprii extinse din varianta deja inclus\u0103. Sursa Savori Urbane a putut fi consultat\u0103 prin informa\u021biile indexate, pagina complet\u0103 fiind blocat\u0103 automat. Am clarificat forma cartofilor, verificarea coacerii \u0219i preg\u0103tirea baconului; fotografiile AI r\u0103m\xe2n orientative.",B.Tp,B.a0G,"1. Spal\u0103 \u0219i \xeenjum\u0103t\u0103\u021be\u0219te. Freac\u0103 bine cartofii sub jet \u0219i \xeendep\u0103rteaz\u0103 ochiurile sau por\u021biunile deteriorate. Usuc\u0103 \u0219i taie pe lung, \xeen jum\u0103t\u0103\u021bi stabile. Nu folosi cartofi verzi. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Cartofii sunt cura\u021bi \u0219i au suprafe\u021be stabile.\n2. Scobe\u0219te f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 str\u0103pungi. Cu o linguri\u021b\u0103 sau un dispozitiv potrivit, scoate o parte din miez, l\u0103s\xe2nd pere\u021bi de circa 7\u201310 mm. Lucreaz\u0103 pe toc\u0103tor, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 \xeempingi lama spre palm\u0103. P\u0103streaz\u0103 miezul pentru alt preparat g\u0103tit. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Fiecare jum\u0103tate are cavitate \u0219i baz\u0103 \xeentreag\u0103.\n3. Preg\u0103te\u0219te br\xe2nzeturile. Rade cheddarul \u0219i ca\u0219cavalul, m\u0103run\u021be\u0219te br\xe2nza de vaci \u0219i amestec\u0103-le cu oul. Adaug\u0103 piper \u0219i pu\u021bin chimen; sarea se pune cu pruden\u021b\u0103 dup\u0103 br\xe2nzeturi \u0219i bacon. Nu gusta amestecul cu ou crud. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Compozi\u021bia este legat\u0103 \u0219i distribuit\u0103 uniform.\n4. G\u0103te\u0219te baconul dac\u0103 eticheta cere. \xcemparte feliile \xeen buc\u0103\u021bi potrivite pentru cavit\u0103\u021bi. Dac\u0103 baconul este crud, g\u0103te\u0219te-l separat conform etichetei \u0219i las\u0103-l s\u0103 se r\u0103coreasc\u0103. Dac\u0103 este gata de consum, urmeaz\u0103 instruc\u021biunile produsului. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Baconul este preg\u0103tit pentru umplere.\n5. Umple \u0219i a\u0219az\u0103 \xeen tav\u0103. Pune buc\u0103\u021bi de bacon \xeen cavit\u0103\u021bi, \xeemp\u0103r\u021bind cele 20 de felii \xeentre jum\u0103t\u0103\u021bile ob\u021binute. Adaug\u0103 compozi\u021bia de br\xe2nz\u0103, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 curg\u0103 peste margini. A\u0219az\u0103 \xeentr-un singur strat \xeentr-o tav\u0103 potrivit\u0103. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Jum\u0103t\u0103\u021bile sunt stabile \u0219i umplutura nu curge \xeen tav\u0103.\n6. Coace \u0219i verific\u0103 dup\u0103 prima etap\u0103. Coace 20 de minute la 180\xb0C cu ventila\u021bie. \xcen\u021beap\u0103 un perete gros de cartof. Dac\u0103 \xeenc\u0103 este tare, acoper\u0103 lejer \u0219i continu\u0103 la aceea\u0219i temperatur\u0103, verific\xe2nd periodic. Nu reduce focul \xeenainte s\u0103 se p\u0103trund\u0103 cartoful. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Cartoful \xeencepe s\u0103 fie fraged, iar umplutura se \xeencheag\u0103.\n7. Termin\u0103 coacerea f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 arzi br\xe2nza. C\xe2nd cartofii sunt aproape gata, po\u021bi reduce la 160\xb0C \u0219i continua 5\u201310 minute. Verific\u0103 minimum 74\xb0C \xeen centrul umpluturii \u0219i cartoful complet fraged la cu\u021bit. Prelunge\u0219te dac\u0103 oricare verificare nu este \xeendeplinit\u0103. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Cartoful este moale, iar umplutura este g\u0103tit\u0103 \u0219i rumen\u0103.\n8. Serve\u0219te cu aten\u021bie la interior. Scoate tava \u0219i las\u0103 cartofii 5 minute \xeenainte s\u0103 \xeei ridici. Umplutura poate fi mult mai fierbinte dec\xe2t pare la exterior. Serve\u0219te cu salat\u0103 sau ca parte a unei mese, aleg\xe2nd por\u021bia dup\u0103 m\u0103rimea cartofilor. Continu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Jum\u0103t\u0103\u021bile pot fi ridicate f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 se r\u0103stoarne umplutura."],t.R)
