B.alk=new A.a(B.Ad,["Folose\u0219te linte ro\u0219ie decorticat\u0103. Preg\u0103te\u0219te chimion m\u0103cinat, dac\u0103 dore\u0219ti aroma oriental\u0103: este alt condiment dec\xe2t chimenul. Cantitatea de ment\u0103 \u0219i l\u0103m\xe2ie se ajusteaz\u0103 dup\u0103 preferin\u021b\u0103.","Oal\u0103, sit\u0103 fin\u0103, toc\u0103tor, cu\u021bit \u0219i blender vertical potrivit pentru lichide calde.","Menta \u0219i chimionul dau arom\u0103: pune-le treptat \u0219i gust\u0103 \xeenainte s\u0103 completezi. Textura se regleaz\u0103 cu ap\u0103 fierbinte ad\u0103ugat\u0103 pu\u021bin c\xe2te pu\u021bin.",B.Zi,B.Vg,"24.10.2026","\u2022 250 g linte ro\u0219ie decorticat\u0103\n\u2022 1 ceap\u0103 mare, 1 morcov, 1 cartof mic\n\u2022 2 linguri ulei\n\u2022 1,5 L ap\u0103, plus ap\u0103 fierbinte pentru reglarea consisten\u021bei\n\u2022 P\xe2n\u0103 la 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 chimion m\u0103cinat, dup\u0103 gust\n\u2022 P\xe2n\u0103 la 1 lingur\u0103 ment\u0103 uscat\u0103, ad\u0103ugat\u0103 treptat dup\u0103 gust\n\u2022 Sare, piper \u0219i l\u0103m\xe2ie pentru servire",B.Sl,"Varianta aplica\u021biei folose\u0219te chimion m\u0103cinat \u0219i ment\u0103, ad\u0103ugate dup\u0103 gust. Gramajele difer\u0103 de re\u021beta folosit\u0103 ca reper de tehnic\u0103.","1. Cl\u0103te\u0219te lintea. Alege lintea, \xeendep\u0103rteaz\u0103 impurit\u0103\u021bile \u0219i cl\u0103te\u0219te-o \xeentr-o sit\u0103 fin\u0103. Las-o s\u0103 se scurg\u0103.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Nu mai exist\u0103 impurit\u0103\u021bi vizibile, iar lintea este scurs\u0103.\n2. Taie legumele. Cur\u0103\u021b\u0103 \u0219i toac\u0103 ceapa, morcovul \u0219i cartoful \xeen buc\u0103\u021bi mici, apropiate ca m\u0103rime.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Cartoful nu are buc\u0103\u021bi mult mai mari dec\xe2t restul.\n3. \xcenmoaie legumele. \xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te uleiul la foc mediu-mic, adaug\u0103 legumele \u0219i amestec\u0103 orientativ 5 minute. Dac\u0103 se prind, redu focul \u0219i pune pu\u021bin\u0103 ap\u0103.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Ceapa \xeencepe s\u0103 se \xeenmoaie \u0219i nu este ars\u0103.\n4. Fierbe lintea. Pune lintea \u0219i apa fierbinte m\u0103surat\u0103. Dup\u0103 revenirea la fierbere, redu focul \u0219i g\u0103te\u0219te orientativ 25 de minute, amestec\xe2nd periodic pe fundul oalei.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Lintea se desface, iar cartoful \u0219i morcovul sunt moi.\n5. Paseaz\u0103 cu grij\u0103. Opre\u0219te focul \u0219i folose\u0219te blenderul vertical cu capul scufundat, pornind lent. Respect\u0103 instruc\u021biunile aparatului pentru lichide fierbin\u021bi.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Supa este fin\u0103, f\u0103r\u0103 buc\u0103\u021bi tari.\nAi grij\u0103: Nu \xeenchide lichid fierbinte \xeentr-un blender etan\u0219 neadecvat.\n6. Potrive\u0219te consisten\u021ba \u0219i condimentele. Adaug\u0103 pu\u021bin chimion \u0219i ment\u0103 din cantitatea preg\u0103tit\u0103, sare \u0219i piper. Dac\u0103 supa este prea dens\u0103, dilueaz\u0103 cu pu\u021bin\u0103 ap\u0103 fierbinte \u0219i omogenizeaz\u0103. Gust\u0103 \xeenainte s\u0103 pui mai multe mirodenii.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Supa curge din polonic, iar condimentele nu domin\u0103.\n7. Serve\u0219te cu l\u0103m\xe2ie la alegere. Pune supa \xeen boluri \u0219i ofer\u0103 l\u0103m\xe2ia separat, ca fiecare s\u0103 \xee\u0219i potriveasc\u0103 acreala.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Supa are textura \u0219i intensitatea aromelor dorite.",B.Px,B.YR,!0,"supe_4_5"],t.R)
