B.aBH=new A.a(B.aCz,["Folose\u0219te carne de miel cu os, cur\u0103\u021bat\u0103 \u0219i por\u021bionat\u0103 de m\u0103celar. Preg\u0103te\u0219te verde\u021burile separat \u0219i nu turna tot bor\u0219ul \xeenainte s\u0103 gu\u0219ti. Sm\xe2nt\xe2na \u0219i ou\u0103le r\u0103m\xe2n la rece p\xe2n\u0103 la dregere.","Oal\u0103 de minimum 7 litri, spumier\u0103, sit\u0103, toc\u0103tor, bol mare, tel \u0219i termometru alimentar.","Durata de fierbere depinde de bucata \u0219i v\xe2rsta animalului. Verde\u021burile ofer\u0103 arom\u0103, dar nu \xeenlocuiesc alegerea \u0219i g\u0103tirea corect\u0103 a c\u0103rnii.",B.a02,B.TH,"24.10.2026","\u2022 1 kg carne de miel cu os, cur\u0103\u021bat\u0103 \u0219i por\u021bionat\u0103\n\u2022 2 leg\u0103turi ceap\u0103 verde, 2 leg\u0103turi usturoi verde\n\u2022 1 morcov\n\u2022 P\xe2n\u0103 la 1 L bor\u0219, ad\u0103ugat dup\u0103 gust\n\u2022 200 g sm\xe2nt\xe2n\u0103\n\u2022 2 g\u0103lbenu\u0219uri\n\u2022 Leu\u0219tean din cele 2 leg\u0103turi preg\u0103tite, dup\u0103 gust\n\u2022 3,5 L ap\u0103, plus ap\u0103 fierbinte pentru evaporare\n\u2022 Sare, dup\u0103 gust",B.R_,"G\u0103te\u0219te carnea p\xe2n\u0103 este fraged\u0103. Dup\u0103 dregerea cu g\u0103lbenu\u0219uri, \xeenc\u0103lze\u0219te lichidul omogenizat p\xe2n\u0103 la minimum 72\xb0C.",u.V,"1. Porne\u0219te baza de miel. Pune carnea por\u021bionat\u0103 \u0219i apa rece m\u0103surat\u0103 \xeen oal\u0103, cu pu\u021bin\u0103 sare. \xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te \u0219i adun\u0103 spuma pe m\u0103sur\u0103 ce apare.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Spuma este \xeendep\u0103rtat\u0103, iar lichidul fierbe lini\u0219tit.\n2. Preg\u0103te\u0219te morcovul \u0219i verde\u021burile. Cur\u0103\u021b\u0103 \u0219i toac\u0103 morcovul m\u0103runt. Spal\u0103 ceapa verde, usturoiul verde \u0219i leu\u0219teanul; taie-le \u0219i p\u0103streaz\u0103-le separat.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Ai separat morcovul de verde\u021burile pentru final.\n3. G\u0103te\u0219te carnea p\xe2n\u0103 este fraged\u0103. Adaug\u0103 morcovul \u0219i fierbe bl\xe2nd orientativ 40 de minute, apoi verific\u0103. Continu\u0103 dac\u0103 furculi\u021ba intr\u0103 greu sau carnea nu se desprinde de pe os. Completeaz\u0103 evaporarea cu ap\u0103 fierbinte.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Carnea este bine g\u0103tit\u0103 \u0219i fraged\u0103, indiferent de timpul scurs.\n4. Dezoseaz\u0103 cu grij\u0103. Scoate carnea. Dup\u0103 ce poate fi manevrat\u0103, elimin\u0103 oasele \u0219i cartilajele \u0219i taie buc\u0103\u021bi pentru servire. Dac\u0103 observi fragmente \xeen zeam\u0103, strecoar-o \xeenainte s\u0103 continui.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Carnea \u0219i zeama nu au fragmente de os.\n5. Adaug\u0103 verde\u021burile \u0219i bor\u0219ul. Pune carnea \xeenapoi, ceapa \u0219i usturoiul verde. D\u0103 bor\u0219ul \xeen clocot separat \u0219i adaug\u0103-l treptat, dup\u0103 gust. Mai fierbe bl\xe2nd aproximativ 5 minute.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Verde\u021burile sunt \xeenmuiate, iar acreala este potrivit\u0103.\n6. Preg\u0103te\u0219te \u0219i tempereaz\u0103 dresul. Omogenizeaz\u0103 g\u0103lbenu\u0219urile cu sm\xe2nt\xe2na. Ia oala de pe foc \u0219i adaug\u0103 \xeen bol c\xe2te pu\u021bin\u0103 zeam\u0103 fierbinte, amestec\xe2nd continuu, p\xe2n\u0103 dresul se \xeenc\u0103lze\u0219te.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Dresul este omogen, f\u0103r\u0103 fulgi de ou.\n7. G\u0103te\u0219te oul. \xcencorporeaz\u0103 dresul \xeen oal\u0103. Re\xeenc\u0103lze\u0219te pe foc mic, amestec\xe2nd, p\xe2n\u0103 lichidul bine omogenizat atinge minimum 72\xb0C. Opre\u0219te focul f\u0103r\u0103 clocot puternic.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Temperatura confirm\u0103 g\u0103tirea oului, iar textura r\u0103m\xe2ne omogen\u0103.\n8. Pune leu\u0219teanul \u0219i gust\u0103. Adaug\u0103 leu\u0219teanul \u0219i gust\u0103 o lingur\u0103 r\u0103corit\u0103. Completeaz\u0103 sarea \u0219i acreala numai dac\u0103 este necesar.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Carnea este fraged\u0103, iar sarea \u0219i bor\u0219ul sunt echilibrate.",B.Wx,B.YQ,!0,"supe_4_5"],t.R)
