B.a34=new A.a(B.aCw,["Varianta de baz\u0103 se poate servi f\u0103r\u0103 sm\xe2nt\xe2n\u0103. Pentru dregere, folose\u0219te sm\xe2nt\xe2na op\u021bional\u0103 la final. Verific\u0103 p\u0103st\u0103ile: cele proaspete mai mature pot avea nevoie de mai mult timp dec\xe2t cele congelate.","Oal\u0103, toc\u0103tor, cu\u021bit, lingur\u0103 \u0219i bol cu tel pentru sm\xe2nt\xe2n\u0103.","G\u0103te\u0219te p\u0103st\u0103ile \xeenainte de ro\u0219ii. Usturoiul \u0219i m\u0103rarul se pun spre final. Gust\u0103 \xeenainte de a ad\u0103uga sare suplimentar\u0103.",B.a0K,B.Vx,"24.10.2026","\u2022 500 g fasole verde p\u0103st\u0103i, proasp\u0103t\u0103 sau congelat\u0103\n\u2022 1 morcov, 1 ceap\u0103 medie, 1 ardei\n\u2022 3 ro\u0219ii mari sau 200 g ro\u0219ii pasate\n\u2022 4 c\u0103\u021bei usturoi\n\u2022 2 linguri ulei pentru \xeen\u0103bu\u0219ire\n\u2022 2,5 L ap\u0103, plus pu\u021bin\u0103 ap\u0103 pentru \xeen\u0103bu\u0219ire\n\u2022 200 g sm\xe2nt\xe2n\u0103, op\u021bional\n\u2022 M\u0103rar \u0219i sare, dup\u0103 gust",B.QG,"1. Preg\u0103te\u0219te p\u0103st\u0103ile \u0219i legumele. Spal\u0103 p\u0103st\u0103ile proaspete, \xeendep\u0103rteaz\u0103 capetele \u0219i eventualele a\u021be \u0219i rupe-le \xeen buc\u0103\u021bi care \xeencap \xeen lingur\u0103. Taie ceapa, morcovul \u0219i ardeiul m\u0103runt. Pentru p\u0103st\u0103i congelate, urmeaz\u0103 eticheta.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: P\u0103st\u0103ile nu au capete tari sau a\u021be.\n2. \xcenmoaie baza de legume. \xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te uleiul pe foc mediu-mic. Pune ceapa, morcovul \u0219i ardeiul cu pu\u021bin\u0103 ap\u0103 \u0219i amestec\u0103 orientativ 5 minute.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Ceapa s-a \xeenmuiat, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 fie ars\u0103.\n3. Fierbe fasolea verde. Toarn\u0103 apa fierbinte m\u0103surat\u0103 \u0219i pune p\u0103st\u0103ile. Fierbe bl\xe2nd orientativ 20 de minute, apoi verific\u0103 \u0219i continu\u0103 dac\u0103 sunt tari.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: P\u0103st\u0103ile se rup \u0219i se mestec\u0103 u\u0219or, f\u0103r\u0103 textur\u0103 crud\u0103.\n4. Adaug\u0103 ro\u0219iile. Pune ro\u0219iile pasate sau t\u0103iate dup\u0103 \xeendep\u0103rtarea pieli\u021bei. Mai g\u0103te\u0219te orientativ 10 minute, amestec\xe2nd u\u0219or.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Ro\u0219iile sunt g\u0103tite \u0219i integrate \xeen zeam\u0103.\n5. Aromatizeaz\u0103 cu usturoi. Piseaz\u0103 usturoiul \u0219i adaug\u0103-l spre final. Las\u0103 un clocot u\u0219or, apoi opre\u0219te focul.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Usturoiul este distribuit uniform.\n6. Drege numai dac\u0103 dore\u0219ti. Pentru varianta f\u0103r\u0103 sm\xe2nt\xe2n\u0103, treci la servire. Altfel, omogenizeaz\u0103 sm\xe2nt\xe2na \xeen bol, \xeenc\u0103lze\u0219te-o treptat cu zeam\u0103 fierbinte, apoi toarn\u0103 amestecul \xeen oal\u0103, amestec\xe2nd.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Sm\xe2nt\xe2na se \xeencorporeaz\u0103 f\u0103r\u0103 aglomer\u0103ri.\n7. \xcencheie cu m\u0103rar. Pune m\u0103rarul sp\u0103lat \u0219i tocat. Gust\u0103 o lingur\u0103 r\u0103corit\u0103 \u0219i ajusteaz\u0103 sarea. Serve\u0219te; varianta cu sm\xe2nt\xe2n\u0103 este cea ilustrat\u0103.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: P\u0103st\u0103ile sunt complet g\u0103tite, iar gustul este potrivit.",B.Yc,B.T9,!0,"supe_4_5"],t.R)
B.avd=new A.a(B.c,["Porne\u0219te supa de pui","Pune puiul \u0219i apa rece m\u0103surat\u0103 \xeen oal\u0103, cu pu\u021bin\u0103 sare. \xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te, adun\u0103 spuma \u0219i redu focul la clocote mici.","Spuma este \xeendep\u0103rtat\u0103, iar zeama fierbe bl\xe2nd.","",0,B.b],t.M)
B.av1=new A.a(B.c,["Taie \u0219i adaug\u0103 r\u0103d\u0103cinoasele","Cur\u0103\u021b\u0103 \u0219i toac\u0103 ceapa uscat\u0103 \u0219i morcovul cubule\u021be. Pune-le \xeen sup\u0103 \u0219i g\u0103te\u0219te orientativ 15 minute, apoi continu\u0103 p\xe2n\u0103 puiul este fraged.","Morcovul este aproape fraged.","",1,B.u],t.M)
B.avw=new A.a(B.c,["Verific\u0103 \u0219i dezoseaz\u0103 puiul","Verific\u0103 minimum 74\xb0C \xeen partea groas\u0103 a c\u0103rnii, f\u0103r\u0103 a atinge osul. Scoate puiul, dezoseaz\u0103-l c\xe2nd poate fi manevrat \u0219i p\u0103streaz\u0103 carnea acoperit\u0103 p\xe2n\u0103 la etapa urm\u0103toare.","Carnea este g\u0103tit\u0103 \u0219i f\u0103r\u0103 fragmente de os.","",-1,B.b],t.M)
B.aoe=new A.a(B.c,["G\u0103te\u0219te maz\u0103rea","Pune maz\u0103rea \u0219i ceapa verde t\u0103iat\u0103 \xeen zeam\u0103. Fierbe conform etichetei sau p\xe2n\u0103 boabele sunt fragede; \xeencepe s\u0103 verifici mai devreme pentru maz\u0103rea congelat\u0103.","Maz\u0103rea este g\u0103tit\u0103, f\u0103r\u0103 centru tare.","",2,B.b],t.M)
B.at7=new A.a(B.c,["Adaug\u0103 ro\u0219iile \u0219i carnea","Pune bulionul sau ro\u0219iile m\u0103run\u021bite \u0219i carnea dezosat\u0103. Adu din nou la fierbere u\u0219oar\u0103, c\xe2t ro\u0219iile se integreaz\u0103 \u0219i carnea se \xeenc\u0103lze\u0219te.","Carnea este fierbinte, iar ro\u0219iile sunt integrate.","",2,B.b],t.M)
B.aqj=new A.a(B.c,["Acre\u0219te dup\u0103 gust","D\u0103 bor\u0219ul \xeen clocot separat \u0219i adaug\u0103-l treptat. Gust\u0103 \u0219i las\u0103 \xeenc\u0103 aproximativ 2 minute la fierbere bl\xe2nd\u0103. Dac\u0103 alegi l\u0103m\xe2ie \xeen loc de bor\u0219, pune-o treptat la final.","Acreala las\u0103 s\u0103 se simt\u0103 \u0219i dulcea\u021ba maz\u0103rii.","",3,B.S],t.M)
B.ato=new A.a(B.c,["\xcencheie cu m\u0103rar","Opre\u0219te focul, pune m\u0103rarul sp\u0103lat \u0219i tocat \u0219i ajusteaz\u0103 sarea \u0219i piperul dup\u0103 ce gu\u0219ti o lingur\u0103 r\u0103corit\u0103.","Puiul este g\u0103tit \u0219i maz\u0103rea este fraged\u0103, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 fie terciuit\u0103.","",4,B.b],t.M)
