B.ajU=new A.a(B.i9,["Folose\u0219te maz\u0103re proasp\u0103t\u0103 sau congelat\u0103, nu uscat\u0103. Spal\u0103 \u0219i preg\u0103te\u0219te verdea\u021ba \u0219i legumele. \u021aine ro\u0219iile \u0219i bor\u0219ul separat pentru etapele de dup\u0103 fr\u0103gezirea c\u0103rnii \u0219i maz\u0103rii.","Oal\u0103, spumier\u0103, toc\u0103tor curat, cu\u021bit, cr\u0103ticioar\u0103 pentru bor\u0219 \u0219i termometru alimentar.","Maz\u0103rea congelat\u0103 se poate g\u0103ti repede: verific-o \u0219i nu prelungi fierberea doar pentru a atinge un num\u0103r fix de minute. Acreala se ajusteaz\u0103 dup\u0103 preferin\u021b\u0103, nu este obligatoriu s\u0103 fie intens\u0103.",B.ZJ,B.UI,"24.10.2026","\u2022 400 g maz\u0103re proasp\u0103t\u0103 sau congelat\u0103\n\u2022 400 g pui por\u021bionat pentru ciorb\u0103\n\u2022 1 morcov, 1 ceap\u0103 uscat\u0103, 1 leg\u0103tur\u0103 ceap\u0103 verde\n\u2022 150 g bulion sau ro\u0219ii decojite\n\u2022 P\xe2n\u0103 la 500 ml bor\u0219, dup\u0103 gust, sau suc de l\u0103m\xe2ie\n\u2022 2,5 L ap\u0103, plus ap\u0103 fierbinte pentru evaporare\n\u2022 M\u0103rar, sare \u0219i piper, dup\u0103 gust",B.Zj,"Verific\u0103 puiul la minimum 74\xb0C \xeen partea groas\u0103. Timpul orientativ nu este suficient: continu\u0103 g\u0103tirea p\xe2n\u0103 c\xe2nd temperatura \u0219i fr\u0103gezimea sunt potrivite.",u.V,"Reperul JamilaCuisine este pentru fierberea puiului, nu o surs\u0103 a gramajelor acestei variante cu maz\u0103re. Maz\u0103rea se g\u0103te\u0219te \xeenainte de ro\u0219ii, pentru controlul texturii.","1. Porne\u0219te supa de pui. Pune puiul \u0219i apa rece m\u0103surat\u0103 \xeen oal\u0103, cu pu\u021bin\u0103 sare. \xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te, adun\u0103 spuma \u0219i redu focul la clocote mici.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Spuma este \xeendep\u0103rtat\u0103, iar zeama fierbe bl\xe2nd.\n2. Taie \u0219i adaug\u0103 r\u0103d\u0103cinoasele. Cur\u0103\u021b\u0103 \u0219i toac\u0103 ceapa uscat\u0103 \u0219i morcovul cubule\u021be. Pune-le \xeen sup\u0103 \u0219i g\u0103te\u0219te orientativ 15 minute, apoi continu\u0103 p\xe2n\u0103 puiul este fraged.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Morcovul este aproape fraged.\n3. Verific\u0103 \u0219i dezoseaz\u0103 puiul. Verific\u0103 minimum 74\xb0C \xeen partea groas\u0103 a c\u0103rnii, f\u0103r\u0103 a atinge osul. Scoate puiul, dezoseaz\u0103-l c\xe2nd poate fi manevrat \u0219i p\u0103streaz\u0103 carnea acoperit\u0103 p\xe2n\u0103 la etapa urm\u0103toare.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Carnea este g\u0103tit\u0103 \u0219i f\u0103r\u0103 fragmente de os.\n4. G\u0103te\u0219te maz\u0103rea. Pune maz\u0103rea \u0219i ceapa verde t\u0103iat\u0103 \xeen zeam\u0103. Fierbe conform etichetei sau p\xe2n\u0103 boabele sunt fragede; \xeencepe s\u0103 verifici mai devreme pentru maz\u0103rea congelat\u0103.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Maz\u0103rea este g\u0103tit\u0103, f\u0103r\u0103 centru tare.\n5. Adaug\u0103 ro\u0219iile \u0219i carnea. Pune bulionul sau ro\u0219iile m\u0103run\u021bite \u0219i carnea dezosat\u0103. Adu din nou la fierbere u\u0219oar\u0103, c\xe2t ro\u0219iile se integreaz\u0103 \u0219i carnea se \xeenc\u0103lze\u0219te.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Carnea este fierbinte, iar ro\u0219iile sunt integrate.\n6. Acre\u0219te dup\u0103 gust. D\u0103 bor\u0219ul \xeen clocot separat \u0219i adaug\u0103-l treptat. Gust\u0103 \u0219i las\u0103 \xeenc\u0103 aproximativ 2 minute la fierbere bl\xe2nd\u0103. Dac\u0103 alegi l\u0103m\xe2ie \xeen loc de bor\u0219, pune-o treptat la final.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Acreala las\u0103 s\u0103 se simt\u0103 \u0219i dulcea\u021ba maz\u0103rii.\n7. \xcencheie cu m\u0103rar. Opre\u0219te focul, pune m\u0103rarul sp\u0103lat \u0219i tocat \u0219i ajusteaz\u0103 sarea \u0219i piperul dup\u0103 ce gu\u0219ti o lingur\u0103 r\u0103corit\u0103.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Puiul este g\u0103tit \u0219i maz\u0103rea este fraged\u0103, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 fie terciuit\u0103.",B.YE,B.a_L,!0,"supe_4_5"],t.R)
